PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,BR-779,Epoetin Alfa,Eposino,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LXCssF9MFHE8EgslxMY_z5RCKHPn1b1I/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/BR-779_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1LXCssF9MFHE8EgslxMY_z5RCKHPn1b1I_view_usp_drivesdk_deacda832e.pdf,page_text/BR-779_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1LXCssF9MFHE8EgslxMY_z5RCKHPn1b1I_view_usp_drivesdk_deacda832e.json,638d81a05713ba0d8532fbb31947b2b60ee0ae49120ea4b94c8820d2ef833173,373011,1,digital_text,,,,,,,,,low,needs_human_review_no_sections_found,2026-06-29T14:05:17.615862+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,BR-797,Enoxaparin (as sodium),Clexane,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/13tT9SdSj3j7G3i6YgJHEqrjW82lxps74/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/BR-797_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_13tT9SdSj3j7G3i6YgJHEqrjW82lxps74_view_usp_drivesdk_b561649582.pdf,page_text/BR-797_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_13tT9SdSj3j7G3i6YgJHEqrjW82lxps74_view_usp_drivesdk_b561649582.json,b859f18400dc1d00a06e003a584c673b4658c933223515d27629d8daf95ce907,16192451,2,digital_text_and_ocr,"including spinal cord decompression should be initiated. Sterile, pyrogen-free solution for injections ° Heparin-induced thrombocytopenia Contained in ready-to-use pre-filled syringes fitted into a cartridge, or in ampoules or in multiple dose vials.",1,1,Pharmaceutical Form(s),"Use of enoxaparin sodium in patients with a history of immune mediated HIT within the past 100 days or in the presence of circulating antibod- ies is contraindicated (see Contraindications). Circulating antibodies may persist several years. + Prophylaxis of venous thrombo-embolic disease, in particular those which may be associated with orthopedic or general surgery. Enoxaparin sodium is to be used with extreme caution in patients with a history (more than 100 days) of heparin-induced thrombocytopenia + Prophylaxis of venous thrombo-embolism in medical patients bedridden due to acute illnesses including cardiac insufficiency, respiratory without circulating antibodies. The decision to use enoxaparin sodium in such a case must be made only after a careful benefit risk assessment failure, severe infections, rheumatic diseases. and after non-heparin alternative treatments are considered. + Treatment of deep vein thrombosis with or without pulmonary embolism. + Prevention of thrombus formation in extra corporeal circulation during hemodialysis. ° Percutaneous coronary revascularisation procedures + Treatment of unstable angina and non-Q-wave myocardial infarction, administered concurrently with aspirin. To minimize the risk of bleeding following the vascular instrumentation during the treatment of unstable angina, non-Q-wave myocardial infarction and acute ST-segment elevation myocardial infarction, adhere precisely to the intervals recommended between Enoxaparin sodium + Treatment of acute ST-segment Elevation Myocardial Infarction (STEMI) including patients to be managed medically or with subsequent Percutaneous Coronary Intervention (PCI). (Clexane) Injection doses. It is important to achieve hemostasis at the puncture site after PCI. In case a closure device is used, the sheath can be",1,1,INDICATIONS,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-29T14:05:50.565646+00:00
