west brain protein binding, the longest delay in onset activity, and the longest duration of action. The plasma DATE OF REVISION OF PACKAGE INSERT half-life for phenobarbital in adults ranges between 53 and 118 hours with a mean of 79 hours. 13 November 2020 The plasma half-life for p (less than 48 hours old) ranges between 60 to 180 hours with a mean of 110 hours. Manufactured by Amherst Laboratories, Inc. Metabolism: ali 4 UNILAB Pharma Campus, Barangay Mamplasan, Binafi, Laguna, Philippines are by the hepatic microsomal enzyme system, and the p are ed in the urine and, less commonly, in the feces. Marketing Authorization Holder: Elimination. PHILUSA CORPORATION 28 Shaw Boulevard, Pasig City Approximately 25% to 50% of a dose of phenobarbital is eliminated unchanged in the urine. The excretion of unmetabolized barbiturate is one feature that distinguishes the long-acting category from those belonging to other seen te which are almost entirely metabolized. The RPBOO of the as vy of g! acid,",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,Phenobarbital is used as an anti-epileptic agent to control tonic-clonic (grand mal) and partial (focal) seizures.,1,1,INDICATION(S),medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-29T18:37:01.347480+00:00
