eartbum, acid indigestion, gas pains, REGISTRATION NUMBER gastritis and peptic ulcer) Sodium bicarbonate 325 mg Tablet: DR-XY26820; Sodium bicarbonate 650 mg Tablet: DR-5070 . Urine alkalinizer DATE OF RENEWAL OF THE AUTHORIZATION Sodium bicarbonate 325 mg Tablet:18 July 2018; Sodium bicarbonate 650 mg Tablet: 20 April 2018 HOW MUCH AND HOW OFTEN SHOULD YOU USE THIS MEDICINE? Sodium bicarbonate 325 mg Tablet: Adult - Orally, 3 to 6 tablets 4 times a day DATE OF REVISION OF PATIENT INFORMATION LEAFLET (PIL) Sodium bicarbonate 650 mg Tablet: Adult - Orally, 2 to 4 tablets 3 times a day 12 November 2020 Or as prescribed by physician, Manufactured by: Amherst Laboratories, Inc. UNILAB Pharma Campus, Barangay Mamplasan, Bifian, Laguna, Philippines WHEN SHOULD YOU NOT TAKE THIS MEDICINE? Precaution should be observed when used in patients with hypertension, kidney, heart disease Marketing Authorization Holder: and in patients under restricted sodium diet since sodium bicarbonate increases levels of sodium PHILUSA CORPORATION in the body. 28 Shaw Bivd., Kapitolyo, Pasig, Metro Manila sodiumbicarbonate-1120 [Page 2]",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-29T18:37:08.500739+00:00
