ablets a day. For therapy — as prescribed by the doctor. DATE OF RENEWAL OF THE AUTHORIZATION Calcium Lactate 325mg Tablet: May 27, 2019 Calcium Lactate 650mg Tablet: July 22, 2019 CARE THAT SHOULD BE TAKEN WHEN TAKING THIS MEDICINE Do not take more than the recommended dose. Plasma- 1 1s should be closely in with renal impairment.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-29T18:42:26.389262+00:00
