PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY17234,Atropine sulfate,Unbranded,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iP-woThzQIibe1dbwqT9J8ZlEMmwpvFN/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY17234_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1iP-woThzQIibe1dbwqT9J8ZlEMmwpvFN_view_usp_drivesdk_ccbf93d6c0.pdf,page_text/DR-XY17234_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1iP-woThzQIibe1dbwqT9J8ZlEMmwpvFN_view_usp_drivesdk_ccbf93d6c0.json,83adcd09414877f8250c175eee9b9a919ed3271f1a3ba94f2cd2378779595e5e,541699,2,digital_text,ATROPINE sulfate Sterile Ophthalmic Solution is an anti-cholinergic prepared as a sterile topical ophthalmic solution.,1,1,DESCRIPTION:,"For mydriasis and/or cycloplegia. For cycloplegic refraction, for pupillary dilation desired in inflammatory conditions of the iris and oveal tract.",1,1,INDICATIONS AND USAGE:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-29T18:50:06.929541+00:00
