ections including otitis media, mastoiditis, sinusitis, follicular tonsillitis, and pharyngitis  Dental infections Note: Penicillin is the usual drug of choice in the treatment and prevention of streptococcal infections, including the prophylaxis of rheumatic fever. Cefalexin is generally effective in the eradication of streptococci from the nasophar- are not available at present.",1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-29T19:03:45.460063+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY26358,RANITIDINE (AS HYDROCHLORIDE),RAXIDE,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MHVdYHykZw-mUdsPulfTxVnuYLYCTiIG/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY26358_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1MHVdYHykZw-mUdsPulfTxVnuYLYCTiIG_view_usp_drivesdk_92f0a5cec9.pdf,page_text/DR-XY26358_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1MHVdYHykZw-mUdsPulfTxVnuYLYCTiIG_view_usp_drivesdk_92f0a5cec9.json,451af5d51831dd6b8189df0ae9326af48359370a4c20238dcb69367515b6cd08,871228,2,ocr,"white to cream, round, biconvex film-coated tablet. RANITIDINE (Raxide”) 150mg or 300mg Tablet is a RAXIDE® is a brand of Ranitidine, a rapidly-acting histamine H, receptor antagonist used in conditions where eficial, such as gastric and duodenal ulcers. inhibition of gastric acid secretion may be ben! It inhibits basal and stimulated secretion of gas! tric acid, reducing both the volume and the acid and pepsin content of the secretion. It has relatively long duration of action and so a single 150mg dose effectively suppresses gastric acid secretion for 12 hours.",1,1,DESCRIPTION:,"luding that associated with H. pylori, NSAID-associated peptic ulcer, Treatment of duodenal and gastric ulcer, inc! chronic episodic dyspepsia, post-operative ulcer, acute reflux esophagitis, Zollinger-Ellison syndrome, symptomatic relief in g »hageal reflux di: and prophylaxis of Mendelson’s syndrome.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-29T19:03:57.659287+00:00
