PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY35252,Cefpodoxime Proxetil,Trizef,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1b-nJ_3VRAK7ROR1FjruBKFy8sKDwmhZT/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY35252_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1b-nJ_3VRAK7ROR1FjruBKFy8sKDwmhZT_view_usp_drivesdk_ef6947780b.pdf,page_text/DR-XY35252_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1b-nJ_3VRAK7ROR1FjruBKFy8sKDwmhZT_view_usp_drivesdk_ef6947780b.json,bb2c9f0dcf3c7a79d5a1df80df2a667a9bbb544912d3a322bc22f43c40ff8f8e,299354,1,digital_text,"Cefpodoxime proxetil is a bactericidal antibiotic and is stable to hydrolysis by many beta-lactamases. It has a mode of action and spectrum of activity similar to those of the third-generation antibiotics. Cefpodoxime also has some activity against Staphylococcus aureus, and may be more active than cefixime against penicillin-resistant strains of Streptococcus pneumoniae.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Cefpodoxime proxetil is used for the treatment of susceptible infections including gonorrhea, otitis media, pharyngitis, lower respiratory tract infections such as bronchitis and urinary tract infections.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T04:17:23.882042+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY35304,Folic Acid,Obsure,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MIFdRlJKSS8tQF164Jdu-9DCkfv4pZPs/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY35304_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1MIFdRlJKSS8tQF164Jdu-9DCkfv4pZPs_view_usp_drivesdk_c829c89ebc.pdf,page_text/DR-XY35304_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1MIFdRlJKSS8tQF164Jdu-9DCkfv4pZPs_view_usp_drivesdk_c829c89ebc.json,e319af4911c9533b350bcb9aed7fa1e4fc13af2fb111ce3d1520686694e21314,1149474,1,ocr,"Orange, round, biconvex, film-coated tablet, plain on both sides.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,Folic acid is indicated in the treatment and prevention of folate deficiency state. It is also used in women of child-bearing potential and pregnant women to protect against neural tube defects in their offspring.,1,1,INDICATIONS:,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T04:17:31.666061+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY35306,Enalapril Maleate,Vasotec,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1A6hRaOHG26cFWOtcpAmv0lOYza2Mi9fC/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY35306_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1A6hRaOHG26cFWOtcpAmv0lOYza2Mi9fC_view_usp_drivesdk_78cc7749e3.pdf,page_text/DR-XY35306_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1A6hRaOHG26cFWOtcpAmv0lOYza2Mi9fC_view_usp_drivesdk_78cc7749e3.json,715dad96f162881bf8831fa55acf37b1c1d3bb8bde7ac212d14798c482fb18c6,1097810,2,ocr,"Vasotec is a pink to carnation pink tablet, round, biconvex, plain on one side and bisected on the other side.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Used in the treatment of hypertension and heart failure. It may also be given prophylactically to patients with asymptomatic left ventricular dysfunction to delay the onset of symptomatic heart failure and to those with left ventricular dysfunction to reduce the incidence of coronary ischaemic events, including myocardial infarction",1,1,INDICATIONS:,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T04:17:43.571705+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY35351,Dextromethorphan Hydrobromide + Guaifenesin,Flemex,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/10ZKaYLN97yipSuS5LaV5IkV-pTFaN0ar/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY35351_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_10ZKaYLN97yipSuS5LaV5IkV-pTFaN0ar_view_usp_drivesdk_efdf02cbe8.pdf,page_text/DR-XY35351_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_10ZKaYLN97yipSuS5LaV5IkV-pTFaN0ar_view_usp_drivesdk_efdf02cbe8.json,afe5bb63c9a68fb916f1feda8c7ebee836da169907ac1a524305cee985d606bd,77847,1,digital_text,Dextromethorphan Hydrobromide + Guaifenesin (Flemex) is an orange-colored syrup. WHAT IS IN THE MEDICINE? Dextromethorphan is a cough suppressant. Acts centrally to elevate the threshold for coughing. It has no analgesic or additive properties. The onset of antitussive action occurs in 15 to 30 minutes after administration and is of long duration. Guaifenesin is an expectorant. Well absorbed from gastrointestinal tract. It is metabolized and then excreted in the urine. Dextromethorphan will not treat a cough that is caused by smoking.,1,1,DESCRIPTION OF THE PRODUCT:,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T04:17:46.460986+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY35361,ACICLOVIR,HAPIVIR,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TkuZw1qlvBlBSGaBaqda3R418fLEvV_L/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY35361_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1TkuZw1qlvBlBSGaBaqda3R418fLEvV_L_view_usp_drivesdk_1cff6a7f2d.pdf,page_text/DR-XY35361_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1TkuZw1qlvBlBSGaBaqda3R418fLEvV_L_view_usp_drivesdk_1cff6a7f2d.json,81450362c8e4860780859c6cac7316518c84a2762c9734326287577b92036a21,2781079,1,ocr,"ADMINISTRATION). There are no data to support the use of aciclovir to prevent transmission of infection to other person or prevent recurrent This product contains aciclovir in a blue violet-colored, sweet grape-flavored suspension. infections when administered in the absence of signs and symptoms. Clinically significant viral resistance associated with the use of",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"discontinued in 2 of these patients. Local pruritus occurred in 4% of these patients. In all studies, there was no significant difference between the drug and placebo group in the rate or type of reported adverse reactions nor were there any differences in abnormal Hapivir suspension is indicated in the treatment of Herpes Simplex virus types 1 and 2 (cold sores and genital herpes) and Varicella Zoster virus (chickenpox and shingles) infections. clinical laboratory findings.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T04:17:56.952382+00:00
