PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY36862,Econopred Plus,Prednisolone (As Acetate),PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tps9UAe2jZP9_hQlwBVbLJuc-eaDV-ur/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY36862_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1tps9UAe2jZP9_hQlwBVbLJuc-eaDV-ur_view_usp_drivesdk_b2a414c647.pdf,page_text/DR-XY36862_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1tps9UAe2jZP9_hQlwBVbLJuc-eaDV-ur_view_usp_drivesdk_b2a414c647.json,a81c95e4239a08e21771c41e7fa2b95fc5374acb7cbeb8feb593f4289a34c089,176534,5,digital_text,"PREDNISOLONE acetate (ECONOPREDTM PLUS) 10mg/mL Sterile Ophthalmic Suspension is an adrenocortical steroid product prepared as sterile ophthalmic suspension. The active ingredient is represented by the chemical structure: Established name: Prednisolone Acetate Chemical name: Pregna-1,4-diene-3,20-dione, 21-(acetyloxy)-11,17-dihydroxy-,(11ß)-. Each mL contains: Active: Prednisolone Acetate 10 mg. Preservative: Benzalkonium Chloride 0.1 mg. Vehicle: Hypromellose Inactives: Dibasic Sodium Phosphate (anhydrous), Polysorbate 80, Edetate Disodium, Glycerin, Citric Acid (monohydrate) and/or Sodium Hydroxide (to adjust pH) Purified Water.",1,1,DESCRIPTION:,"Steroid responsive inflammatory conditions of the palpebral and bulbar conjunctiva, cornea and anterior segment of the globe such as allergic conjunctivitis, acne rosacea, superficial punctate keratitis, herpes zoster keratitis, iritis, cystitis, selected infective conjunctivitides, when the inherent PREDNISOLONE acetate [Page 2] hazard of steroid use is accepted to obtain an advisable diminution in edema and inflammation; corneal injury from chemical, radiation, or thermal burns, or penetration of foreign bodies. PREDNISOLONE acetate (ECONOPREDTM PLUS) 10mg/mL Sterile Ophthalmic Suspension is for the treatment of conditions for which corticosteroid therapy is indicated except adrenocortical - deficiency states.",1,2,INDICATIONS AND USAGE:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T04:26:55.568335+00:00
