PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY37299,Losartan Potassium + Hydrochlorothiazide,Wilopres Plus,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/16kUA8BWGh382ND7ekqIL7A5EWeEag6J2/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY37299_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_16kUA8BWGh382ND7ekqIL7A5EWeEag6J2_view_usp_drivesdk_8d4e0106dc.pdf,page_text/DR-XY37299_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_16kUA8BWGh382ND7ekqIL7A5EWeEag6J2_view_usp_drivesdk_8d4e0106dc.json,7eec5bed8657e738a08e86c3c744684022d899f1a4b258887d4c1e687a8b7ef1,582587,1,digital_text,"Losartan Potassium + Hydrochlorothiazide 50 mg/12.5 mg Film-Coated Tablet is a white to off-white, round, biconvex, film-coated tablet, plain on both sides. Losartan Potassium + Hydrochlorothiazide 100 mg/25 mg Film-Coated Tablet is a white to off-white, round, biconvex, film-coated tablet, plain on both sides.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,Losartan Potassium + Hydrochlorothiazide is indicated for the treatment of hypertension. It is also indicated to reduce risk of stroke in patients with hypertension and left ventricular hypertrophy.,1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T04:32:05.169731+00:00
