PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY37553,Loratadine,Lorange,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pSd8x_zdLLeU7rngz2U0yKLsjKBuORHI/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY37553_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1pSd8x_zdLLeU7rngz2U0yKLsjKBuORHI_view_usp_drivesdk_abbaf3d455.pdf,page_text/DR-XY37553_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1pSd8x_zdLLeU7rngz2U0yKLsjKBuORHI_view_usp_drivesdk_abbaf3d455.json,1a85587be0393ef9738fdb042e553327e7e119c02d43a0d80d1c8ff56780c509,422070,1,digital_text,"Orange, round, mottled, biconvex, uncoated tablet, bisected on one side and plain on the other side. WHAT IS IN THE MEDICINE? The medicine contains Loratadine, a long-acting, non-sedating antihistamine, with no significant antimuscarinic activity. It blocks the action of histamine and relieves allergy symptoms. Histamine is a chemical released by the immune system - the body’s defense against invading substances - when the body is affected by substances that you are allergic to (allergens).",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T04:33:18.908540+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY37578,Mecobalamin,Mebaal-500,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1H4-Eq-crDFpxApJTwW6vzmq5kygbRFrM/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY37578_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1H4-Eq-crDFpxApJTwW6vzmq5kygbRFrM_view_usp_drivesdk_bc2d74597c.pdf,page_text/DR-XY37578_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1H4-Eq-crDFpxApJTwW6vzmq5kygbRFrM_view_usp_drivesdk_bc2d74597c.json,0cf8cd36221b0470ead915c5c61d0989409ca931575f00804b3c3b909266dee0,2397355,1,ocr,"Antibiotics: The use of antibiotics may alter the intestinal microflora and may decrease the possible contribution of mecobalamin by certain inhabitants of the Mecobalamin is one of the two active coenzyme forms of vitamin B-12. It is a co-factor to the enzyme methionine synthetase that function to transfer methyl microflora (e.g. Lactobacillus species) to the body's requirement for the vitamin. This may particularly be a problem for vegetarians. Garlic, onions, leeks, groups for the regeneration of methionine from homocysteine. It is closely involved in folate metabolism, and is pivotal for the synthesis of purines and bananas, asparagus and artichokes, among other vegetables and fruits, contain inulins, which promote the growth of certain colonic bacteria, including pyrimidines. It also acts as a methyl donor forthe synthesis of lecithin, a major component of myelin sheath. Lactobacillus species. Cholestyramine: Cholestyramine may decrease the enterohepatic reabsorption of mecobalamin.",1,1,DESCRIPTION:,"MEBAAL-500 / MEBAAL-1500 Peripheral neuropathy, dementia, alcoholic neuropathy, drug-induced neuropathy, trigeminal and occupational neuralgia, Parkinson’s disease, Bell's palsy, 500 mcg / 1.5 mg Film-coated Tablet megaloblastic anemia, cancer, male impotence, hyperhomocysteinemia, sleep disturbances. Vitamin",1,1,INDICATIONS:,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T04:33:36.780873+00:00
