PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY39968,Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with 4.25% Dextrose,CAPD/DPCA 3,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mXx6ZjTEPu9z8tk2gygVACrNphHqtTB9/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY39968_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1mXx6ZjTEPu9z8tk2gygVACrNphHqtTB9_view_usp_drivesdk_6fb57c40db.pdf,page_text/DR-XY39968_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1mXx6ZjTEPu9z8tk2gygVACrNphHqtTB9_view_usp_drivesdk_6fb57c40db.json,20e34c29e1cbfcb9c420a7381af12803aab73f43fef9d09e47bf55b4beded135,662012,12,digital_text,"What Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 1.5%, 4.25% & 2.3% (CAPD/DPCA 2, 3 & 4) The active substances contained in one litre of each Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose1.5%, 4.25% & 2.3% (CAPD/DPCA 2, 3 & 4) solutions are: Sodium chloride 5.786 g Sodium-(S)-lactate-solution (equivalent to 3.925 g Sodium-(S)- 7.85 g lactate) Calcium chloride dihydrate 257.3 mg Magnesium chloride hexahydrate 101.7 mg These quantities of active substances are equivalent to: 134 mmol/L sodium ions, 1.75 mmol/L calcium ions, 0.5 mmol/L magnesium ions, 103.5 mmol/L chloride ions and 35 mmol/L lactate ions. An additional active substance is: Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 1.5% (CAPD/DPCA 2) Glucose monohydrate 16.5 g equivalent to 15.0 g glucose (83.2 mmol/l) Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 4.25% (CAPD/DPCA 3) Glucose monohydrate 46.75 g equivalent to 42.5 g glucose (235.8 mmol/l) Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 2.3% (CAPD/DPCA 4) Glucose monohydrate 25.0 g equivalent to 22.73 g glucose (126.1 mmol/l) The other ingredients of Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 1.5%, 4.25% & 2.3% (CAPD/DPCA 2, 3 & 4) are: Water for injection, hydrochloric acid, sodium hydroxide",6,6,DESCRIPTION,"Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 1.5%, 4.25% & 2.3% (CAPD/DPCA 2, 3 & 4) are used for cleaning the blood via the peritoneum in patients with end- stage chronic kidney failure. This type of blood cleaning is called peritoneal dialysis. 1. 2. 6 Package Insert Information for the user Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 1.5%, 4.25% & 2.3% CAPD/DPCA 2, CAPD/DPCA 3 & CAPD/DPCA 4 Peritoneal Dialysis Solution In this leaflet: 1. Description",6,6,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T04:52:47.727444+00:00
