idney failure. This type of blood cleaning is called peritoneal dialysis. 1. 2. 6 Package Insert Information for the user Peritoneal Dialysis Solution with Dextrose 1.5%, 4.25% & 2.3% CAPD/DPCA 2, CAPD/DPCA 3 & CAPD/DPCA 4 Peritoneal Dialysis Solution In this leaflet: 1. Description",6,6,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T04:52:51.120819+00:00
