 caution until definitive interaction studies can Immune system disorders Very rare Hypersensitivity reactions (including be completed. The number of subjects who concomitantly received angioedema and anaphylaxis) macrolide antibiotics, Ketaconazole, Cimetidine, Ranitidine, or Nervous system disorders Very rare Nervous system disorders Theophylline along with Loratadine in controlled clinical trials is Cardiac disorders Very rare Tachycardia, palpitation too small to rule out possible drug interactions. Gastrointestinal disorders Very rare Nausea, dry mouth, gastritis",1,1,INDICATIONS,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T05:07:21.769258+00:00
