PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY44847,Paracetamol + Caffeine,None,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IiVa3WwOIyu7iZt3uVN4Xc1BAPaoXgrS/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY44847_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1IiVa3WwOIyu7iZt3uVN4Xc1BAPaoXgrS_view_usp_drivesdk_e02fae9f2e.pdf,page_text/DR-XY44847_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1IiVa3WwOIyu7iZt3uVN4Xc1BAPaoXgrS_view_usp_drivesdk_e02fae9f2e.json,4f84f13a14cd3799a7f7b9b59f304003350db596aadd4884c4c4a544fcf88093,553249,2,ocr,"Paracetamol + Caffeine Tablet is a white to off-white, oblong, biconvex, film-coated tablet, plain on both sides. WHATIS IN THE MEDICINE? It is a combination tablet that contains two active ingredients. Paracetamol is a painkiller and reduces your temperature when you have a fever. Caffeine acts to further help the effectiveness of paracetamol. STRENGTH OF THE MEDICINE?",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T06:11:36.595719+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY44850,Rosuvastatin (as calcium),Ruvastin-10,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lHxzrGj83U5qaK-6OX4XR4YostQrVxPv/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY44850_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1lHxzrGj83U5qaK-6OX4XR4YostQrVxPv_view_usp_drivesdk_67875804d7.pdf,page_text/DR-XY44850_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1lHxzrGj83U5qaK-6OX4XR4YostQrVxPv_view_usp_drivesdk_67875804d7.json,d537577d1f8c483e6c75524928c5c97c34d204cbba5ebce69d24b5f9ed759485,758530,1,ocr,"A white to almost white, heart shaped and biconvex film coated tablet, having breakline on both sides. Pharmacology: Rosuvastatin is selective, potent and competitiv e inhibitor of HMG-CoA reductase effective in ) cholesterol and triglyc erides. It produces its lipid modifying lowering LDL (Low-Density Lipoprotein he number if hepatic LDL receptors on the cell surface to effects in two ways; firstly it increases t d secondly it inhibits the hepatic synthesis of VLDL (Very enhance uptake and catabolism of LDL an Low Density Lipoprotein), which reduces the total num ber of VLDL & LDL particles.",1,1,Product Description:,"(type lla or Ilb hyperlipoproteinaemias), Used in the treatm ent of hyperlipidaemia and may also be hypertriglyceridaemia (type \V), and primary dys! betalipoproteinaemia (type III), used as adjunct therapy in pa tients with homozygous familial hyperch olesterolaemia who have some LDL-receptor function, and in cardiovascular risk reaction.",1,1,Indications:,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T06:12:12.661335+00:00
