h (2S)-1,2-propanediol, hydrate (1:1:1). The empirical formula is C21H25ClO6•C3H8O2•H2O and the formula weight is 502.98. The structural",1,1,3. PHARMACEUTICAL FORM,Dapagliflozin/Metformin HCl (XIGDUO XR) is indicated in adults with type 2 diabetes mellitus when treatment with both dapagliflozin and metformin is appropriate: - for the treatment of type 2 diabetes mellitus as an adjunct to diet and exercise. - for the prevention of new or worsening heart failure or cardiovascular death (see section 5.1) - for the prevention of new or worsening nephropathy (see section 5.1),3,3,4.1. Therapeutic Indications,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T06:17:44.596543+00:00
