creatinine clearance. In addition, pregabalin * Total daily dose (mg/day) should be divided as indicated by dose regimen to provide mg/dose. is effectively removed from plasma by hemodialysis (following a 4 hour hemodialysis t+ Supplementary dose is a single additional dose. treatment plasma pregabalin concentrations are reduced by approximately 50%). Because",1,1,indication of racemization of pregabalin S-enantiomer to the R-enantiomer.,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T06:38:49.060401+00:00
