 with, or is suspected to be associated with cIAI, cUTI, or HAP/VAP. Consideration should be given to official guidance on the appropriate use of antibacterial agents.",2,2,4.1 Therapeutic Indications,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T07:53:19.316644+00:00
