PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY46872,Paracetamol,Unbranded,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tP6-HjHX4CUhkEeTgaDZQyxuUYJorOqV/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY46872_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1tP6-HjHX4CUhkEeTgaDZQyxuUYJorOqV_view_usp_drivesdk_9984c6d887.pdf,page_text/DR-XY46872_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1tP6-HjHX4CUhkEeTgaDZQyxuUYJorOqV_view_usp_drivesdk_9984c6d887.json,dc87d400930bac047a7d7e67cec92652f0da663ed3e012f6228a8141e2fe6897,441958,2,digital_text,"Paracetamol 100 mg/mL Suspension (Oral Drops): • A melon-colored, thick suspension with fruity melon odor, and sweet, juicy, rindy, melon taste. Paracetamol 120 mg/5 mL suspension : • A melon-colored, thick suspension with fruity melon odor, and sweet, juicy, rindy, melon taste. Paracetamol 250 mg/ 5 mL suspension: • A melon-colored, thick suspension with fruity melon odor, and sweet, juicy, rindy, melon taste. Paracetamol 100 mg/mL Suspension (Oral Drops), Paracetamol 120 mg/5 mL ® suspension, Paracetamol 250 mg/ 5 mL suspension use the TasteRite technology.® The TasteRite technology is a unique tastemasking system developed specifically for liquid dosage forms. This technology significantly reduces the bitterness of medicine so that children taste the flavor and not the medicine. In addition, this product uses the TFTech™ Tooth Friendly for Medicines technology to significantly reduce or eliminate enamel loss that leads to tooth decay. WHAT IS IN THE MEDICINE? These products contain Paracetamol, a fever reducer and pain reliever. STRENGTH OF THE MEDICINES",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T07:53:42.857185+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY46873,Paracetamol,Unbranded,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/12cPo7o1MNT5DiciBAgNLxqTpCc30ylKA/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY46873_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_12cPo7o1MNT5DiciBAgNLxqTpCc30ylKA_view_usp_drivesdk_e4b3d711b5.pdf,page_text/DR-XY46873_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_12cPo7o1MNT5DiciBAgNLxqTpCc30ylKA_view_usp_drivesdk_e4b3d711b5.json,47cfd417277cbdf8c91040c1ff35192ab09a69714ba72a0bb6e2dcef2145ca6c,445658,2,digital_text,"Paracetamol 100 mg/mL Suspension (Oral Drops): • A berry-colored, thick suspension with fruity berry odor, and sweet, juicy, rindy, berry taste. Paracetamol 120 mg/5 mL suspension : • A berry-colored, thick suspension with fruity berry odor, and sweet, juicy, rindy, berry taste. Paracetamol 250 mg/ 5 mL suspension: • A berry-colored, thick suspension with fruity berry odor, and sweet, juicy, rindy, berry taste . Paracetamol 100 mg/mL Suspension (Oral Drops), Paracetamol 120 mg/5 mL ® suspension, Paracetamol 250 mg/ 5 mL suspension use the TasteRite technology.® The TasteRite technology is a unique tastemasking system developed specifically for liquid dosage forms. This technology significantly reduces the bitterness of medicine so that children taste the flavor and not the medicine. In addition, this product uses the TFTech™ Tooth Friendly for Medicines technology to significantly reduce or eliminate enamel loss that leads to tooth decay. WHAT IS IN THE MEDICINE? These products contain Paracetamol, a fever reducer and pain reliever. STRENGTH OF THE MEDICINES",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T07:53:45.808309+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY46876,Palbociclib,Ibrance,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HUIct1k9QV_mQs6NnupWUh8RZEPFLiIQ/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY46876_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1HUIct1k9QV_mQs6NnupWUh8RZEPFLiIQ_view_usp_drivesdk_ff548d193c.pdf,page_text/DR-XY46876_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1HUIct1k9QV_mQs6NnupWUh8RZEPFLiIQ_view_usp_drivesdk_ff548d193c.json,12cd32a89fb4a085297eb0cdf9b85e203dea7a87ec76edaf4cb38cd918b306e6,766979,35,digital_text,"Palbociclib (Ibrance) is chemically designated as 6-acetyl-8-cyclopentyl-5-methyl-2- {[5 (piperazin-1-yl) pyridin-2-yl] amino} pyrido[2,3-d]pyrimidin-7(8H)-one. It h as the following chemical structure: N N N Me O N H N N HN O M e The empirical formula for Palbociclib (Ibrance) is C24H29N7O2 and the molecular weight is 447.54 Dalton with CAS Registry 571190-30-2. Palbociclib is a yellow to orange powder with a pKa of 7.4 (secondary piperazine nitrogen) and 3.9 (pyridine nitrogen). The solubility of Palbociclib in aqueous media decreases over the range pH 4.3 to pH 9.0 from greater than 0.7 mg/mL t o less than 0.002 mg/mL. At or below pH 4, Palbociclib behaves like a high-solubility c ompound. Above pH 4, the solubility o f the drug substance reduces significantly. The partition coefficient (1-octanol/water) at pH 7.4 is 0.99.",1,1,2.0 DESCRIPTION,"Palbociclib (Ibrance) is indicated for the treatment of hormone receptor (HR)-positive, human epidermal growth factor receptor 2 (HER2)-negative advanced or metastatic breast cancer in combination with:  an aromatase inhibitor as initial endocrine-based therapy  fulvestrant in patients who have received prior therapy.",2,2,4.1 Therapeutic Indications,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T07:53:49.625091+00:00
