PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY47451,Salmeterol (as xinafoate) + Fluticasone propionate,Saltrol,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/108rPVV0wcm9XK5stY7a-tHQ-VUOknjM5/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY47451_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_108rPVV0wcm9XK5stY7a-tHQ-VUOknjM5_view_usp_drivesdk_85884997f7.pdf,page_text/DR-XY47451_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_108rPVV0wcm9XK5stY7a-tHQ-VUOknjM5_view_usp_drivesdk_85884997f7.json,8b3e4fc630422cab83249f66635a0253dc1cd3eee48df812032f5088f28f299e,47934,2,digital_text,Salmeterol + Fluticasone propionate (Saltrol) 25mcg / 125mcg is a metered dose pressurized inhalation suspension consisting of an Aluminum canister fitted over a light purple color actuator along with a dark purple color cap. The inhaler also contains the CFC-free propellant HFA 134a. Upon spraying on black sheet white smear will appear. Each canister contains at least 120 actuations. Salmeterol + Fluticasone propionate (Saltrol) 25mcg / 250mcg is a metered dose pressurized inhalation suspension consisting of an Aluminum canister fitted over a dark purple color actuator along with a light purple color cap. The inhaler also contains the CFC-free propellant HFA 134a. Upon spraying on black sheet white smear will appear. Each canister contains at least 120 actuations.,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,Asthma (Reversible Obstructive Airways Disease): Salmeterol + Fluticasone propionate (Saltrol) is indicated in the regular treatment of asthma (Reversible Obstructive Airways Disease). This may include: - Patients on effective maintenance doses of long-acting ß agonists and inhaled corticosteroids. - Patients who are symptomatic on current inhaled corticosteroid therapy. - Patients on regular bronchodilator therapy who require inhaled corticosteroids. Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD): Salmeterol + Fluticasone propionate (Saltrol) is indicated in the regular treatment of Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD) including chronic bronchitis and emphysema.,1,1,THERAPEUTIC INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T08:35:20.192009+00:00
