PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY48407,Indacaterol Acetate + Glycopyrronium Bromide + Mometasone Furoate,Enerzair Breezhaler,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1007A3iPd_buwrwPm372x5VvabsWebsJS/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY48407_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1007A3iPd_buwrwPm372x5VvabsWebsJS_view_usp_drivesdk_5422385445.pdf,page_text/DR-XY48407_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1007A3iPd_buwrwPm372x5VvabsWebsJS_view_usp_drivesdk_5422385445.json,f8535673d8f3e6ec950674b957417239e58bf7f489fca915522e5a9cf58d3ff3,655036,28,digital_text,"Pharmaceutical form(s) Indacaterol/glycopyrronium/mometasone furoate 150/50/80 micrograms , inhalation powder, hard capsules. Indacaterol/glycopyrronium/mometasone furoate 150/50/160 micrograms , inhalation powder, hard capsules. Active substance(s) Each capsule of Enerzair Breezhaler 150/50/80 micrograms contains 173 micrograms of indacaterol acetate equivalent to 150 micrograms of indacaterol, 6 3 micrograms of glycopyrronium bromide equivalent to 50 micrograms glycopyrronium and 80 micrograms mometasone furoate. Each capsule of Enerzair Breezhaler 150/50/160 micrograms contains 173 micrograms of indacaterol acetate equivalent to 150 micrograms of indacaterol, 6 3 micrograms of glycopyrronium bromide equivalent to 50 micrograms glycopyrronium and 160 micrograms mometasone furoate The delivered dose (the dose that leaves the mouthpiece of the inhaler) for 150/50/80 micrograms is equivalent to 114 micrograms indacaterol, 46 micrograms glycopyrronium, and 68 micrograms mometasone furoate. The delivered dose (the dose that leaves the mouthpiece of the inhaler) for 150/50/160 micrograms is equivalent to 114 micrograms indacaterol, 46 micrograms glycopyrronium, and 136 micrograms mometasone furoate. Indacaterol acetate + Glycopyrronium bromide + Mometasone furoate [Page 2] Excipients Capsule fill: Lactose (as monohydrate), Magnesium stearate. Capsule shell components: Hypromellose, Purified water, Carrageenan, Potassium chloride.",1,2,DESCRIPTION AND COMPOSITION,"Enerzair Breezhaler is indicated as a once -daily maintenance treatment of asthma, and to reduce asthma exacerbations, in adults not adequately controlled with a maintenance combination of a long-acting beta2-agonist and an inhaled corticosteroid.",2,2,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T09:36:53.541938+00:00
