PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY48486,Silodosin,Ureleve,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UTaxMz_tG97zlrAhKlOj4UWXISgKS_Dn/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY48486_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1UTaxMz_tG97zlrAhKlOj4UWXISgKS_Dn_view_usp_drivesdk_638ddd2cf5.pdf,page_text/DR-XY48486_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1UTaxMz_tG97zlrAhKlOj4UWXISgKS_Dn_view_usp_drivesdk_638ddd2cf5.json,8a9a43fceba52211f8e8a7782a2a7bed84e3461238c5ca3e662acbbe5bd0581c,1374822,5,digital_text,"2mg – Ivory/Ivory, hard gelatin capsules of size “3” self-locking, containing white coloured, granular powder. 4mg – Orange/White, hard gelatin capsules of size “3” self-locking, containing white coloured, granular powder. 8mg – Pink/White, hard gelatin capsules of size “3” self-locking, containing white coloured, granular powder.",1,1,DESCRIPTION,"Silodosin is a selective alpha-1 adrenergic receptor antagonist, indicated for the treatment of the signs and symptoms of benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH). Silodosin is not indicated for the treatment of hypertension.",3,3,INDICATION,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T09:40:14.342663+00:00
