PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DR-XY48494,Ondansetron (as hydrochloride dihydrate),Frenvo,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aJZIS4186CSZk-Vgvgci3CXAt5zYIFVG/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DR-XY48494_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1aJZIS4186CSZk-Vgvgci3CXAt5zYIFVG_view_usp_drivesdk_618aeff0dd.pdf,page_text/DR-XY48494_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1aJZIS4186CSZk-Vgvgci3CXAt5zYIFVG_view_usp_drivesdk_618aeff0dd.json,4b909f38af566374eb4e8df67b4e699f1aa0ec34ae288c03cffda4a6f30bc726,1499206,2,digital_text,"Clear, colourless syrup with strawberry flavour.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Ondansetron Syrup is indicated for the management of nausea and vomiting induced by cytotoxic chemotherapy and radiotherapy. Ondansetron Syrup is also indicated for the prevention of post-operative nausea and vomiting (PONV). For treatment of established PONV, administration by injection is recommended.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T09:52:31.642429+00:00
