e capsules in combination with rituximab (anti-CD20 antibody) is indicated for the treatment of adult patients with previously treated follicular lymphoma (Grade 1 – 3a).",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T12:12:49.518467+00:00
