PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRHR-2243,Isopropyl Alcohol,Katinko,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1skS0LJYvaGrC4VKSUpx6Hp2gIXyKA2aA/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRHR-2243_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1skS0LJYvaGrC4VKSUpx6Hp2gIXyKA2aA_view_usp_drivesdk_f9ade59f4c.pdf,page_text/DRHR-2243_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1skS0LJYvaGrC4VKSUpx6Hp2gIXyKA2aA_view_usp_drivesdk_f9ade59f4c.json,c2f14b46a37371d952e590f82899ca8bcabf512b247a8b26c527bdb748fe4fad,683466,4,digital_text,,,,,"of prickly heat, insect bites, hygienic purposes, after shave, and general antiseptic. For use in the hospital or sick room as a rubdown or for general massage purposes. DIRECTION: Apply on hands and rub on skin. PRECAUTION: Can cause skin rash, itching, dryness and redness. WARNING: FOR EXTERNAL USE ONLY. Flammable. Keep out of reach of children. Do not swallow or use near eyes, ears, and mouth. For suspected adverse drug reaction, report to the FDA: www.fda.gov.ph. Seek medical attention immediately at the ﬁrst sign of any adverse drug reaction. STORAGE CONDITION: Store at temperatures not exceeding 30°C. Do not freeze. 70 mL [Page 3] with Moisturizer PROUDLY MADE IN THE PHILIPPINES ANTISEPTIC/DISINFECTANT 70% (v/v) Solution KATINKO Alco ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL DRHR-2243 250 mL [Page 4] *Philippine Packaging Manufactured by:",2,4,"INDICATION: For disinfection, sterilization, relief",low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T12:22:53.953822+00:00
