PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-10014,Tranexamic Acid,Hemoclot,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZGUpkMDm-szolZG3UTsVMC9jxcEDiBLt/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-10014_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ZGUpkMDm-szolZG3UTsVMC9jxcEDiBLt_view_usp_drivesdk_191af819e8.pdf,page_text/DRP-10014_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ZGUpkMDm-szolZG3UTsVMC9jxcEDiBLt_view_usp_drivesdk_191af819e8.json,343f288236e8d549f3b7b202a2588c14469080b864fdea2f749bc5fbae21ffd3,262562,1,digital_text,"Hemoclot (Tranexamic Acid) is a white crystalline powder, odorless, has a bitter taste encapsulat- ed in empty gelatin capsule size #0 with brown op. cap and yellow op. body.",1,1,DESCRIPTION:,"Used in the treatment of hemorrhage, or threatened hemorrhage, associated with excessive fibrinolysis. It is many times more potent than aminocaproic acid.",1,1,INDICATION:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-29T14:14:17.636878+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-10015,Cloxacillin (As Sodium),Solaze,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eSMdYFEFjcXpPy2H-k0UxZC-l44FbSeM/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-10015_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1eSMdYFEFjcXpPy2H-k0UxZC-l44FbSeM_view_usp_drivesdk_ec3053594e.pdf,page_text/DRP-10015_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1eSMdYFEFjcXpPy2H-k0UxZC-l44FbSeM_view_usp_drivesdk_ec3053594e.json,5c96dd71a250258719178e30dd5f0d3ba90cc38306a60742516db0d93b4d16a2,569376,1,digital_text,"Cefalexin (Solaze®) Capsule: White to off-white crystalline powder encapsulated in empty gelatin capsule size #0 with black opaque cap and yellow opaque body, each containing 500 mg Cloxacillin. Cloxacillin (Solaze®) Powder for Solution: White to off-white powder. Prepared by adding water to the powder to give Banana flavored and clear solution containing 250 mg Cloxacillin in each 5mL. Cloxacillin (Solaze®) Powder for Solution: Off-white to yellowish white powder. Prepared by adding water to the powder to give Melon flavored and orange solution containing 125 mg Cloxacillin in each 5mL.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS:,"Cloxacillin is an isoxazolyl penicillin used primarily for the treatment of infectious due to staphylococci resistant to benzylpenicillin, including infections of the skin and soft tissues, bones and joints, respiratory tract and urinary tract; otitis media, endocarditis, septicemia and meningitis. It is also used for mixed streptococcal infections when the staphylococci are penicillin resistant. It is also used for the prophylaxis of staphylococcal infections during major procedures, particularly in the cardiothoracic and orthopedic surgery.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-29T14:14:20.954003+00:00
