PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-10511,Febuxostat,Febunol-80,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FZ8hifTVXEYp8x0VhJ_6gx3LDmtWVzQe/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-10511_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1FZ8hifTVXEYp8x0VhJ_6gx3LDmtWVzQe_view_usp_drivesdk_52b38ef6d5.pdf,page_text/DRP-10511_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1FZ8hifTVXEYp8x0VhJ_6gx3LDmtWVzQe_view_usp_drivesdk_52b38ef6d5.json,9f9559bec2c93106fda1e9230afe697da3949d6df75861b197de7b36e2f40d30,1580810,1,digital_text,,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"The apparent steady state volume of distribution (Vss/F) of febuxostat ranges from 29 to 75 L after oral doses of 10-300 mg. The plasma protein binding of febuxostat is approximately 99.2%, (primarily to albumin) and is constant over the concentration range achieved with 80 and 120 mg doses. Plasma protein binding of the active metabolites ranges from about 82% to 91%.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-29T14:24:38.374248+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-10511,Febuxostat,Febunol-80,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QAAy9X28smqv0nx-3flPB9GhZyvY3ARm/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-10511_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1QAAy9X28smqv0nx-3flPB9GhZyvY3ARm_view_usp_drivesdk_15e4e10342.pdf,page_text/DRP-10511_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1QAAy9X28smqv0nx-3flPB9GhZyvY3ARm_view_usp_drivesdk_15e4e10342.json,b1befd91fd0df219873f534024f17f034d86faa73dfd209ff423e5c82aa17bd8,490901,1,digital_text,"Diosmin + Hesperidin acts on the lymphatic system: It improves lymphatic drainage by increasing lymph flow and lymph oncotic pressure. This action on the lymphatic system associated with a phlebotonic and vasculoprotective effect, explains the activity of Diosmin + Hesperidin on CVD-associated edema. Diosmin + Hesperidin is highly effective in the treatment of chronic hemorrhoids disease. It significantly improves subjective symptoms and objective signs e.g., anal discomfort, pain, redness, anal discharge, proctitis, tenesmus, pruritus, erythema and bleeding. Diosmin + Hesperidin also significantly reduces the frequency, severity and duration of acute hemorrhoidal attacks and bleeding by chronic treatment. Always take Diosmin + Hesperidin exactly as your doctor or health care provider has told you. Usual Dose: Chronic Venous Disease: 2 tablets daily with meals STRENGTH OF THE MEDICINE NAME OF THE PRODUCT This medicine contains Diosmin + Hesperidin and is a phlebotonic and a vascular-protecting agent. The efficacy of Diosmin + Hesperidin is accounted for by its specific action on the principal elements of venous disease. This medicine is used for the treatment of the symptoms and signs of organic and idiopathic chronic venous disease of the lower limbs e.g., heavy legs, pain, heat sensation, edema, functional impairment and nocturnal cramps. Treatment of the symptoms of acute hemorrhoidal attacks and chronic hemorrhoidal treatment. Chronic Hemorrhoidal Disease: 2 tablets daily with meals Should be taken with food: Take at mealtime. WHEN SHOULD YOU NOT TAKE THIS MEDICINE? WHAT SHOULD I TAKE NOTE OF WHILE TAKING THIS MEDICINES? UNDESIRABLE EFFECTS OF THIS MEDICINES If you develop rashes, breathlessness, swollen mouth, lips, tongue or eyes, stop taking this medicine and inform your doctor immediately. These could be sign of an allergic reaction. WHAT OTHER MEDICINES OR FOOD SHOULD BE AVOIDED WHILE TAKING THIS MEDICINE? Diosmin + Hesperidin may cause any of the following side effects: headache, dizziness, diarrhea, indigestion, stomach pain, nausea, vomiting, constipation and skin itching. Inform your doctor and pharmacist if you are taking any of these medicines: -diclofenac (NSAID or medicine for pain and inflammation) -fexofenadine (medicines for cold and allergy) This list does not include all medicines that may interact with Diosmin + Hesperidin Always notify your doctor and pharmacist if you are taking any other medicines, including herbal tonics such as traditional Chinese medicines, supplements and medicines that you buy without a prescription. WHAT SHOULD YOU DO IF YOU MISS A DOSE? Take the missed dose as soon as you remember. If it is almost time for your next dose, skip the missed dose and return to your normal dosing schedule. Do not double a dose under any circumstances. If you often forget to take your medicines, let your doctor and pharmacist know. -chlorzoxazone (medicines used for muscle spasm pain) Store at temperatures not exceeding 30°C.",1,1,DESCRIPTION OF THE PRODUCT,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-29T14:24:41.341119+00:00
