PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-10771-01,,,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ecZ5JOT7lEgUsl6j3sirz0H8yIWs0b_7/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-10771-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ecZ5JOT7lEgUsl6j3sirz0H8yIWs0b_7_view_usp_drivesdk_2e4858e7be.pdf,page_text/DRP-10771-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ecZ5JOT7lEgUsl6j3sirz0H8yIWs0b_7_view_usp_drivesdk_2e4858e7be.json,aa4b403cd6367bfa2c3edcfb0301cf610fe673d7003b8208f79dd5e63dbeea5b,775775,2,digital_text,"Film coated tablet, yellow thin glossy coating, with Ethica's emboss logo on each side.",1,1,Pharmaceutical Form,Prevention and treatment of damages due to faulty or deficient protein metabolism in chronic kidney disease in connection with a limited dietary protein intake of 40 g/day or less (for adults). Usually this applies to patients whose glomerular filtration rate (GFR) is less than 25 mL/min.,1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-29T14:36:48.934081+00:00
