PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-12080-03,Nebivolol (as hydrochloride),Nebilax,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1F4f3o2Ynl1WRdM7f-Tmy3nRRMRxVSnjn/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-12080-03_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1F4f3o2Ynl1WRdM7f-Tmy3nRRMRxVSnjn_view_usp_drivesdk_4016930611.pdf,page_text/DRP-12080-03_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1F4f3o2Ynl1WRdM7f-Tmy3nRRMRxVSnjn_view_usp_drivesdk_4016930611.json,a2855619899f944ba8f293d4a98f7f300eedc35acf52efb211ac314184b904ba,501904,1,digital_text,"Both nebivolol enantiomers are rapidly absorbed after oral administration. The absorption of nebivolol is not affected by food; nebivolol can be given with or without meals. LVEF less than 35% in 56% of patients, LVEF between 35% and 45% in 25% of patients and LVEF greater than 45% in 19% of patients) followed for a mean time of 20 months, nebivolol, on top of standard therapy, significantly prolonged the time to occurrence of deaths or hospitalizations for cardiovascular reasons (primary end-point for efficacy) with a relative risk reduction of 14% (absolute reduction: 4.2%). This risk reduction developed after 6 months of treatment and was maintained for all treatment duration (median duration: 18 months). The effect of nebivolol was independent from age, gender, or left ventricular ejection fraction of the population on study. The benefit on all cause mortality did not reach statistical significance in comparison to placebo (absolute reduction: 2.3%). In vitro and in vivo experiments in animals showed that Nebivolol has no intrinsic sympathicomimetic activity. Treatment of essential hypertension. Treatment of stable mild and moderate chronic heart failure in addition to standard therapies in elderly patients ≥ 70 years.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"When unchanged active substance plus active metabolites are considered, the difference in peak plasma concentrations is 1.3 to 1.4 fold. Because of the variation in rates of metabolism, the dose of nebivolol tablets should always be adjusted to the individual requirements of the patient: poor metabolizers therefore may require lower doses. In a mortality–morbidity, placebo-controlled trial performed in 2128 patients ≥ 70 years (median age 75.2 years) with stable chronic heart failure with or without impaired left ventricular ejection fraction (mean LVEF: 36 ± 12.3%, with the following distribution:",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-29T15:27:48.164206+00:00
