PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-12333,Diosmin + Hesperidin,Diosmed 1000,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_0PxTrNfugO0-8KgXc6C2No4iUhTjB0Y/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-12333_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1_0PxTrNfugO0-8KgXc6C2No4iUhTjB0Y_view_usp_drivesdk_22ca721e9e.pdf,page_text/DRP-12333_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1_0PxTrNfugO0-8KgXc6C2No4iUhTjB0Y_view_usp_drivesdk_22ca721e9e.json,893b339dd1c465d5c62e59de1eab960189b7da4d98e0d790d89ec544405647ec,314548,1,digital_text,"Peach colored oval shaped film coated tablet having break line on one side. WHAT IS IN THE MEDICINE AND STRENGTH OF THE MEDICINE? Each tablet contains: Diosmin IHS…………………….. 900 mg Hesperidin IHS…………………….. 100 mg WHAT IS THIS MEDICINE USED FOR? This medicine is a venotonic (it increases venous tone) and a vasculoprotector (it increases resistance in small blood vessels). It is recommended for treating venous circulation disorders (swollen legs, pain, early morning restless legs) and for treating symptoms due to acute haemorrhoidal attack. HOW MUCH & HOW OFTEN SHOULD YOU USE THIS MEDICINE? Venous insufficiency: 1 tablet daily, at mealtime. Hemorrhoidal attack: The recommended dose is 3 tablets per day for 4 days and then 2 tablets per day for the next 3 days, at mealtimes. Must be taken orally, by mouth.",1,1,DESCRIPTION OF THE PRODUCT:,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-29T15:38:10.687567+00:00
