PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-12495L,,,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iBp-hBS2Fsx57pxHkoB0tMue498U5oKB/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-12495L_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1iBp-hBS2Fsx57pxHkoB0tMue498U5oKB_view_usp_drivesdk_d7edf7624c.pdf,page_text/DRP-12495L_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1iBp-hBS2Fsx57pxHkoB0tMue498U5oKB_view_usp_drivesdk_d7edf7624c.json,1eb11e9bbd0d907cd39d18cdac8085473c9b8cdbf5ca0fe6610b759a3c9fd8e3,3947587,8,digital_text_and_ocr,"Exicof Raspberry Flavor is red viscous syrup with odor and taste of menthol and raspberry. Exicof Strawberry Flavor is red viscous syrup with odor and taste of menthol and strawberry. Exicof Menthol Flavor is red viscous syrup with odor and taste of menthol. Dextromethorphan HBr is a cough suppressant used for the relief of non-productive cough; it has a central action on the cough center in the medulla. Guaifenesin increases the volume and reduces the tenacious sputum and is used as an expectorant for productive cough. Phenylephrine HCl is a sympathomimetic with mainly direct effects on adrenergic receptors; used for the symptomatic relief of nasal congestion and relief of cough and cold symptoms. WHAT IS THIS MEDICINE USED FOR? The preparation is indicated for respiratory tract disorders with pathologically increased mucus viscosity, elimination of phlegm during inflammation of the nasal cavity and throat, suppresses cough, and relieves cough and cold symptoms. HOW MUCH AND HOW OFTEN SHOULD YOU USE THIS MEDICINE? Adults and children over 12 years: 10mL (2 teaspoonful) every 4 hours up to 14 days. Medical advice should be sought if the symptoms last longer than 14 days and/or if the symptoms increase in spite of treatment. WHEN SHOULD YOU NOT TAKE THIS MEDICINE? Hypersensitivity to any of the ingredients. [Page 6] Taking a prescription monoamine oxidase inhibitor (MAOI), a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI), or other medications for depression, psychiatric, or emotional conditions, or Parkinson's disease, or for 2 weeks after stopping the medication. Severe hypertension and hyperthyroidism. Avoid in patients with prostatic enlargement.Patients taking monoamine oxidase inhibitors, or within 14 days of ceasing such treatment. CARE THAT SHOULD BE TAKEN WHEN TAKING THIS MEDICINE? Patients suffering from chronic cough as occurs with smoking, asthma or patients suffering from an acute asthma attack, or where cough is accompanied by excessive secretions should be advised to consult a Healthcare Professional before use. Causes of chronic cough should be excluded if symptoms are persistent. Any accompanying symptoms should be actively sought and appropriately investigated/ treated. Stop use and ask your healthcare professional if your cough lasts more than 7 days, comes back or is accompanied by a fever, rash or persistent headache. These could be signs of serious",5,6,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,"Exicof Exicof Seek medical attention immediately at the first The preparation is indicated for 30mg/200mg/10mg per 10mL Syrup sign of any adverse drug reaction. 30mg/200mg/10mg per 10mL Syrup respiratory tract disorders with Cough Suppresant/Expectorant Cough Suppresant/Expectorant pathologically increased mucus viscosity, For suspected adversed drug reaction, report to elimination of phlegm during the FDA: www.fda.gov.ph inflammation of the nasal cavity and throat, suppress cough and relives cough and cold symptoms. Store at temperatures not exceeding 30 C Keep out of reach of children. For more information, please see Patient Information Leaflet. Menthol-Strawberry Flavor Menthol-Strawberry Flavor Manufactured by: Manufactured by: Interphil Laboratories, Inc. Interphil Laboratories, Inc. Canlubang Industrial Estate Canlubang Industrial Estate Bo. Pittland Cabuyao Bo. Pittland Cabuyao Laguna, Philippines Laguna, Philippines [Page 2] :a3eq “dxJ :33eq ‘Zi “ON UdIeg - ON YG jUeJ0}DedxI/JUessiddns ysnoD dniAs JWOT Jed BwQT/B8wi90z7/BwoE JO1xX3 IDH eulsydajAuaud ulsauajienyd JQH ueudsouyaWiOIxeqG TW O¢T 120 mL 120 mL FORMULATION",1,2,INDICATION,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-29T16:01:55.633994+00:00
