PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-13913,Ambroxol Hydrochloride,Expel,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/18JjJjKgsdxTrP8dmybQeSvW_EfNmTiXE/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-13913_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_18JjJjKgsdxTrP8dmybQeSvW_EfNmTiXE_view_usp_drivesdk_21c1487083.pdf,page_text/DRP-13913_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_18JjJjKgsdxTrP8dmybQeSvW_EfNmTiXE_view_usp_drivesdk_21c1487083.json,76e3bcc4ced1224254ee56bfbdd7e6eb8298de7585722b8c21342777f961a58a,872970,2,digital_text,"Ambroxol hydrochloride (Expel®) 6 mg/mL Syrup (Oral Drops) is a colorless to very light yellow-colored, clear to slightly hazy syrup with the odor and taste of orange. Ambroxol hydrochloride (Expel®) 15 mg/5 mL Syrup is a colorless to very light yellow-colored, clear to slightly hazy syrup with the odor and taste of orange. WHAT IS IN THE MEDICINE? This medicine contains ambroxol, a mucolytic, which stimulates fluid secretion in the respiratory tract and breaks down mucus resulting in the production of less thick and less sticky mucus/phlegm. Ambroxol improves mucociliary clearance (mucus flow and transport) making phlegm easier to cough up and expel. STRENGTH OF THE MEDICINE",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T12:31:50.380645+00:00
