PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-14390,Telmisartan + Amlodipine (as besilate),TeliSolv Pro,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YTXuWfEfVH87lwKZssB80Lz4DXHLXeOK/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-14390_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1YTXuWfEfVH87lwKZssB80Lz4DXHLXeOK_view_usp_drivesdk_6110954cff.pdf,page_text/DRP-14390_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1YTXuWfEfVH87lwKZssB80Lz4DXHLXeOK_view_usp_drivesdk_6110954cff.json,8acda2a51a361c6021b86b3a187c7698c095138a8bd9ddc77d816ee7eba01e00,2769429,2,digital_text,"Telmisartan + Amlodipine (as besilate) 80 mg/10 mg and 40 mg/5 mg tablet appears as white to off-white and light brown to beige oblong shaped two layer tablets, biconvex, plain on both sides.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,Treatment of essential hypertension. Replacement Therapy Patients receiving telmisartan and amlodipine besilate from separate tablets may instead receive Telmisartan + Amlodipine containing the same component doses. Add on Therapy Telmisartan + Amlodipine besilate is indicated in patients whose blood pressure is not adequately controlled on telmisartan or amlodipine monotherapy. Initial therapy Telmisartan + Amlodipine besilate may also be used as initial therapy in patients who are likely to need multiple drugs to achieve their blood pressure goals. The choice of Telmisartan + Amlodipine besilate as initial therapy for hypertension should be based on an assessment of potential benefits and risks.,1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T12:50:30.131775+00:00
