PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-1639,Cefuroxime (As Sodium),Proxim,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Pz-yxlTXVeKyi5dir0aXJ1LOxPloMSqU/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-1639_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1Pz-yxlTXVeKyi5dir0aXJ1LOxPloMSqU_view_usp_drivesdk_0e3a2e7188.pdf,page_text/DRP-1639_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1Pz-yxlTXVeKyi5dir0aXJ1LOxPloMSqU_view_usp_drivesdk_0e3a2e7188.json,a65d2d8322e24a2a3ef296adfee4bf0ff009c235b739f07f575a69e0f42e8235,442524,1,digital_text,White to almost white powder.,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Cefuroxime is indicated for treatment of susceptible infections. These have included bone and joint infections, bronchitis (and lower respiratory tract infections), gonorrhea, meningitis, otitis media, peritonitis, pharyngitis, sinusitis, skin infections (including soft tissue infections, surgical infections), surgical infection (prophylaxis), and urinary tract infections.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T13:11:12.123190+00:00
