tion is",2,3,4.1 Therapeutic Indications,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T13:29:13.729929+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-2149,Losartan Potassium + Hydrochlorothiazide,A.R.A. + H,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WdFfIP8k1Mkg36Az8OEGjmjMjzR4O4ud/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-2149_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1WdFfIP8k1Mkg36Az8OEGjmjMjzR4O4ud_view_usp_drivesdk_35c60222bb.pdf,page_text/DRP-2149_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1WdFfIP8k1Mkg36Az8OEGjmjMjzR4O4ud_view_usp_drivesdk_35c60222bb.json,6149585671ec4057b0209c46acd1f82e7e342b8a15f19191e58f469dd23bc906,8281730,2,digital_text,,,,,"Adverse reaction Hepatitis Hyperkalaemia, elevation of ALT rare rare Frequency System organ class Blood and lymphatic system disorders Adverse reaction anaemia, Henoch-Schönlein purpura, ecchymosis, haemolysis thrombocytopenia Uncommon Frequency Not knownthrombocytopenia common Cardiac disorders Uncommon Ear and labyrinth disorders Eye disorders vertigo, tinnitus Vertigo. tinnitus Uncommon Uncommon Gastrointestinal disorders General disorders and administration site conditions Hepatobiliary disorders Immune system disorders abdominal pain, nausea, diarrhea, dyspepsia liver function abnormalities asthenia, fatigue, chest pain pancreatitis Not known common facial oedema, oedema, fever Uncommon Not known hypersensitivity: anaphylactic reactions, angiooedema including swelling of the larynx and glottis causing airway obstruction and/or swelling of the face, lips, pharynx, and/or tongue; in some of these patients angiooedema had been reported in the past in connection with the administration of other medicinal products, including ACE inhibitors; rare Not known Uncommon uncommon common Not known uncommon common uncommon Not known common uncommon common uncommon Metabolism and nutrition disorders Nervous system disorders Psychiatric disorders Skin and subcutaneous tissue disorders Vascular disorders Investigations Musculoskeletal and connective tissue disorders Renal and urinary disorders Reproduc