PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-3221-01,Iron + Zinc + Folic Acid,HEME-UP FA,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SoHiKcmvoDFn1TLpsyRn_yog20ol1miA/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-3221-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1SoHiKcmvoDFn1TLpsyRn_yog20ol1miA_view_usp_drivesdk_83a65dd27c.pdf,page_text/DRP-3221-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1SoHiKcmvoDFn1TLpsyRn_yog20ol1miA_view_usp_drivesdk_83a65dd27c.json,b578408142cbaadb3b11f7ac9e34b17a6deca196598d10452e6d0674742fe899,38605,1,digital_text,"Red cap and transparent body hard gelatin capsules size “1” containing white, golden, silver and yellow enteric coated granules",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Used in the treatment of Iron deficiency anemia and other anemias like megaloblastic anemia (due to folic acid deficiency), treatment of Zinc deficiency, which may occur specially during pregnancy. Folic acid is also used to prevent Neural Tube Birth Defect.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T14:39:20.601341+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-324,Cefalexin (as monohydrate),Exel,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zzGPn-FLKyoxKI_NBVtj2fpC8YN11Eo_/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-324_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1zzGPn-FLKyoxKI_NBVtj2fpC8YN11Eo__view_usp_drivesdk_f932c12144.pdf,page_text/DRP-324_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1zzGPn-FLKyoxKI_NBVtj2fpC8YN11Eo__view_usp_drivesdk_f932c12144.json,85acfc9bbbdd00a7f1a47637f4e18af3b678d3b8f6cb8135db334a0764a16aa3,79358,1,digital_text,"Cefalexin (Exel) 500 mg Capsule is a white to oﬀ-white crystalline powder contained in gray/yellow rich hard gelatin capsule. Cefalexin (Exel) 250 mg Capsule is a white to oﬀ-white powder contained in scarlet/gray hard gelatin capsule. Cefalexin (Exel) 250 mg/5 mL Powder for Suspension is a white to oﬀ-white powder, and very light to light orange suspension upon reconstitution, orange ﬂavored, and with characteristic odor. Cefalexin (Exel) 125 mg/5 mL Powder for Suspension is a white to white-cream powder, and light orange to orange suspension upon reconstitution, orange ﬂavored and with characteristic odor. Cefalexin (Exel) 100 mg/mL Powder for Suspension (Oral Drops) is a white to oﬀ- white powder, peach to light orange suspension upon reconstitution, orange ﬂavored and with characteristic odor.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"the following conditions, when caused by susceptible bacteria. Respiratory tract infections, Acute and chronic bronchitis and infected bronchiectasis. Ear, nose and throat infections: Otitis media, mastoiditis, sinusitis, follicular tonsillitis and pharyngitis. Urinary tract infections: Acute and chronic pyelonephritis, cystitis and prostatitis. Prophylaxis of recurrent urinary tract infection. Gynaecological and obstetric infections Skin, soft -tissue and bone infections. DOSAGE AND MODE OF",1,1,INDICATION: It is indicated for treatment of,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T14:39:23.671177+00:00
