PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-3538,Escitalopram (as oxalate),Feliz S 10,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1h5OGQ7_83LBoFusUhtkZAgLis-T9S4Vj/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-3538_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1h5OGQ7_83LBoFusUhtkZAgLis-T9S4Vj_view_usp_drivesdk_e12b92b7be.pdf,page_text/DRP-3538_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1h5OGQ7_83LBoFusUhtkZAgLis-T9S4Vj_view_usp_drivesdk_e12b92b7be.json,1092ea9ced71a820997d90ec9379dea5fb9a8ee37c60044f34d8eda5c32e63c0,393600,1,digital_text,"Escitalopram Oxalate is an orally administered selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI). The chemical name of Escitalopram Oxalate is S(+)1-[3-(dimethyl amino) propyl]-1-(4-fluorophenyl)-1, 3-dihydro-5-isobenzofuran (oxalate salt). Its molecular formula is C20H21FN2O (Base) and C20H21FN2O.C2H2O4 (oxalate salt) and its molecular weight is 324.40 (base) and 414.42 (oxalate salt). Escitalopram (Feliz S 10) Film-Coated Tablet is a white to off white, round, binconvex, film-coated tablet, debossed with breakline on both sides, separating “11” and “36” on one side and “10” on other side. Escitalopram (Feliz S 20) Film-Coated Tablet is a white to off white, round, binconvex, film-coated tablet, debossed with breakline on both sides, separating “11” and “37” on one side and “20” on other side.",1,1,DESCRIPTION:,"Used for the acute and maintenance treatment of major depressive disorder in adults and adolescents 12 to 17 years of age. Used for the management of generalised anxiety disorder, obsessive-compulsive disorder, panic disorder with or without agoraphobia, social phobia, and post- traumatic stress disorder.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T14:46:49.378044+00:00
