PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-3610,Citicoline (as sodium),Nervcare,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qOHXFfjsv0rETFv8Ps6covBMloo4nG1D/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-3610_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1qOHXFfjsv0rETFv8Ps6covBMloo4nG1D_view_usp_drivesdk_fe50da7f10.pdf,page_text/DRP-3610_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1qOHXFfjsv0rETFv8Ps6covBMloo4nG1D_view_usp_drivesdk_fe50da7f10.json,b038d5cbf9da4f6f5af548f437ef52800ab88bacaeca8363118d840298b5c467,287981,1,digital_text,"Citicoline is a derivative of choline and cytidine that is involved in the biosynthesis of lecithin. It is claimed to increase blood flow and oxygen consumption in the brain and has been given in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders, Parkinsonism, and head injury. Citicoline is an interneuronal communication enhancer. It increases the neurotransmission levels because it favors the synthesis and production speed of dopamine in the striatum acting then as a dopaminergic agonist thru the inhibition of tyrosine-hydroxylase. Citicoline acts as a presynaptic cholinergic agent which favors the synthesis of acetylcholine. It also decreases the release of serotonin. Citicoline makes the neurons more active, causing the astrocytes to loosen their grip on the capillaries, thus improving microcirculation. It has the ability to slightly increase cerebral blood flow and exerts an anti-aggregation effect on platelets. Citicoline (Nervcare) 500 mg Capsule is characterized by white to off-white granular powder free from dirt and lumps encapsulated in empty gelatin capsule size #00 with scarlet cap and scarlet body. Each capsule contains: Citicoline (as sodium)....................... 500 mg",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Citicoline 1 g Film-Coated Tablet is used in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders including ischemic stroke, parkinsonism and head injuries. Citicoline 500 mg Capsule is to increase blood flow and oxygen consumption in the brain and has been given in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders (including ischemic stroke), parkinsonism, and head injury. Must not be administered to patients with hypertonia of the parasympathetic.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T14:49:03.608654+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-3610-02,Citicoline (as sodium),Z-Colin,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/19EPS1Xwghx7YXgYDQ59SFSHTrm7BnYoT/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-3610-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_19EPS1Xwghx7YXgYDQ59SFSHTrm7BnYoT_view_usp_drivesdk_72c0dde770.pdf,page_text/DRP-3610-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_19EPS1Xwghx7YXgYDQ59SFSHTrm7BnYoT_view_usp_drivesdk_72c0dde770.json,7392f33f62dc7e210ca084842d1dd5e893e01f3965445ddc4814c1c1040e67fb,471191,1,digital_text,"Citicoline is a derivative of choline and cytidine that is involved in the biosynthesis of lecithin. It is claimed to increase blood flow and oxygen consumption in the brain and has been given in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders, parkinsonism, and head injury. Citicoline is an interneuronal communication enhancer. It increases the neurotransmission levels because it favors the synthesis and production speed of dopamine in the striatum acting then as a dopaminergic agonist thru the inhibition of tyrosine-hydroxylase. Citicoline acts as a presynaptic cholinergic agent which favors the synthesis of acetylcholine. It also decreases the release of serotonin. Citicoline makes the neurons more active, causing the astrocytes to loosen their grip on the capillaries, thus improving microcirculation. It has the ability to slightly increase cerebral blood flow and exerts an anti-aggregation effect on platelets. Citicoline 1 gram Film-Coated Tablet: Characterized by light purple to purple film coated, biconvex tablet, oval shaped, plain on both sides. Citicoline 500 mg Capsule: Characterized by white to off-white granular powder free from dirt and lumps encapsulated in empty gelatin capsule size #00 with scarlet cap and scarlet body.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Citicoline 1 gram Film-Coated Tablet It is used in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders including ischemic stroke, parkinsonism and head injuries. Citicoline 500 mg Capsule To increase blood flow and oxygen consumption in the brain and has been given in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders (including ischemic stroke), parkinsonism, and head injury.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T14:49:00.508683+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-3611-02,Citicoline (As Sodium),Z-Colin,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ukpyBQRGBhZtoTidKLYB_Nug294nE_hS/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-3611-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ukpyBQRGBhZtoTidKLYB_Nug294nE_hS_view_usp_drivesdk_1c6849b474.pdf,page_text/DRP-3611-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ukpyBQRGBhZtoTidKLYB_Nug294nE_hS_view_usp_drivesdk_1c6849b474.json,be5a2b2403a3685d99378e80595378e76dce9ae16d5b55c7a163e9537b7df488,474183,1,digital_text,"Citicoline is a derivative of choline and cytidine that is involved in the biosynthesis of lecithin. It is claimed to increase blood flow and oxygen consumption in the brain and has been given in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders, parkinsonism, and head injury. Citicoline is an interneuronal communication enhancer. It increases the neurotransmission levels because it favors the synthesis and production speed of dopamine in the striatum acting then as a dopaminergic agonist thru the inhibition of tyrosine-hydroxylase. Citicoline acts as a presynaptic cholinergic agent which favors the synthesis of acetylcholine. It also decreases the release of serotonin. Citicoline makes the neurons more active, causing the astrocytes to loosen their grip on the capillaries, thus improving microcirculation. It has the ability to slightly increase cerebral blood flow and exerts an anti-aggregation effect on platelets. Citicoline 1 gram Film-Coated Tablet: Characterized by light purple to purple film coated, biconvex tablet, oval shaped, plain on both sides. Citicoline 500 mg Capsule: Characterized by white to off-white granular powder free from dirt and lumps encapsulated in empty gelatin capsule size #00 with scarlet cap and scarlet body.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Citicoline 1 gram Film-Coated Tablet It is used in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders including ischemic stroke, parkinsonism and head injuries. Citicoline 500 mg Capsule To increase blood flow and oxygen consumption in the brain and has been given in the treatment of cerebrovascular disorders (including ischemic stroke), parkinsonism, and head injury.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T14:49:06.816773+00:00
