PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-3953,Valsartan + Hydrochlorothiazide,Torval H 160/12.5,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EHYw28lJdL-j0w7wTJ658s-d2s2ji2Er/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-3953_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1EHYw28lJdL-j0w7wTJ658s-d2s2ji2Er_view_usp_drivesdk_c90e69ef18.pdf,page_text/DRP-3953_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1EHYw28lJdL-j0w7wTJ658s-d2s2ji2Er_view_usp_drivesdk_c90e69ef18.json,edbf34b173372a886de5d8954dbce4032085504ad79b28c1ded0370a678a28b2,309096,1,digital_text,"Valsartan + Hydrochlorothiazide (Torval H 80/12.5 ) 80 mg / 12.5 mg is a white to off white colored, oval shaped, beveled edge, biconvex film coated tablet debossed with “1071” on one side and plain on other side. Valsartan + Hydrochlorothiazide (Torval H 160/12.5) 160 mg / 12.5 mg is a pink colored, oval shaped, beveled edge, biconvex film coated tablet debossed with “1072” on one side and plain on other side. Valsartan + Hydrochlorothiazide (Torval H 160/25) 160 mg / 25 mg is a yellow colored, oval shaped, beveled edge, biconvex film coated tablet with breakline on both sides.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,Valsartan and hydrochlorothiazide is indicated for the treatment of hypertension. This fixed-dose combination is not indicated for initial therapy.,1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T14:58:40.404512+00:00
