PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-4737,Etoricoxib,Bixocot,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mLT6H_BjIGQ-IsBN_1HDH3QHCa4kY40c/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-4737_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1mLT6H_BjIGQ-IsBN_1HDH3QHCa4kY40c_view_usp_drivesdk_228d07ffbf.pdf,page_text/DRP-4737_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1mLT6H_BjIGQ-IsBN_1HDH3QHCa4kY40c_view_usp_drivesdk_228d07ffbf.json,83fc1fb2beb422268897f86dc2a2ac1a078e6a351a0d06673c1eefa3f89d61fa,832406,1,digital_text,,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Etoricoxib is an NSAID reported to be a selective inhibitor of cyclooxygenase-2 (COX-2). It is used in the symptomatic relief of rheumatoid arthritis, osteoarthritis and acute gouty arthritis. Etoricoxib should not be used in patients with ischemic heart disease, peripheral arterial disease, or cerebrovascular disease. It should be used with caution in patients with significant risk factors for cardiovascular disease such as hypertension, hyperlipidemia, and diabetes mellitus.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T15:46:05.058730+00:00
