les in response to calcium, potassium, epinephrine, serotonin, and thromboxane A2 analog in experimental animal models and in human coronary vessels in vitro. This inhibition of coronary spasm is responsible for the effectiveness of Amlodipine in vasospastic (Prinzmetal's or variant) angina.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T15:47:34.798010+00:00
