PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-4820-01,Fluorouracil,Fluororac,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GaIRI5-DFDNNIn2GNfcy5DhuX0eVZVxO/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-4820-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1GaIRI5-DFDNNIn2GNfcy5DhuX0eVZVxO_view_usp_drivesdk_3030fd7489.pdf,page_text/DRP-4820-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1GaIRI5-DFDNNIn2GNfcy5DhuX0eVZVxO_view_usp_drivesdk_3030fd7489.json,eae4c5fe5271a5bf1dc6158bf1a4db10a4071a47678c72d67b72f5c333f05b05,481466,2,digital_text,"Fluorouracil is a fluorinated pyrimidine; it is chemically 5-fluoro-2, 4 (1H, 3H)- pyrimidinedione. It is a white to practically white crystalline powder which is sparingly soluble in water. Fluorouracil injection is an anti-neoplastic, anti- metabolite, sterile, non-pyrogenic injectable solution for intravenous administration. The molecular weight of Fluorouracil is 130.08 and the structural formula: C H FN O4 3 2 2 HANDLING AND DISPOSAL Store at temperatures not exceeding 30°C. It is recommended to avoid herb/neutraceutical such as black cohosh, dong quai in estrogendependent tumors.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,"Selection of an appropriate dose and treatment regimen depend upon the condition of the patient, the type of carcinoma being treated and whether Fluorouracil is to be administered alone or in combination with other therapy. All dosages are based on the patient's actual weight. However the estimated lean body mass (dry weight) is used if the patient is obese or if there has been a spurious weight gain due to edema, ascites or other forms of abnormal fluid retention. It is recommended that prior to treatment each patient should be carefully evaluated in order to estimate as TM accurately as possible the optimum initial dosage of Fluorouracil . Fluorouracil (Fluororac) is a clear and colorless to almost colorless solution. TM Fluorouracil is present in two strength's 250 mg/5 mL and 500 mg/10 mL ampoules/vials. PRODUCT DESCRIPTION Fluorouracil is a fluorinated pyrimidine; it is chemically 5-fluoro-2, 4 (1H, 3H)- pyrimidinedione. It is a white to practically white crystalline powder which is sparingly soluble in water. Fluorouracil injection is an anti-neoplastic, anti- metabolite, sterile, non-pyrogenic injectable solution for intravenous administration. The molecular weight of Fluorouracil is 130.08 and the structural formula: C H FN O4 3 2 2 HANDLING AND DISPOSAL Store at temperatures not exceeding 30°C. It is recommended to avoid herb/neutraceutical such as black cohosh, dong quai in estrogendependent tumors.",1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T15:50:03.817723+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-4820-02,Fluorouracil,Racifluoro,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zuMYQqF4decQZ2i4cRkyx9__ISyOu-Dd/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-4820-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1zuMYQqF4decQZ2i4cRkyx9__ISyOu-Dd_view_usp_drivesdk_1fbcdcddb2.pdf,page_text/DRP-4820-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1zuMYQqF4decQZ2i4cRkyx9__ISyOu-Dd_view_usp_drivesdk_1fbcdcddb2.json,1670bcf496304d1356011b2aea3cc3a913cca6fbc1016d807a4942da8f351e53,490309,2,digital_text,"Fluorouracil is a fluorinated pyrimidine; it is chemically 5 - fluoro - 2, 4 (1H, 3H) - pyrimidinedione. It is a white to practically white crystalline powder which is sparingly soluble in water. Fluorouracil injection is an antineoplastic, anti- metabolite, sterile, non-pyrogenic injectable solution for intravenous administration. Fluorouracil injection is clear and colorless to almost colorless liquid. The molecular weight of fluorouracil is 130.08 and the structural formula: C H FN O4 3 2 2 Fluorouracil is present in two strengths 250 mg/5 mL and 500 mg/10 mL ampoules/vials.",1,1,DESCRIPTION,"Fluorouracil is effective in the palliative management of carcinoma of the colon, rectum, breast, stomach and pancreas.",1,1,INDICATION(S),high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T15:50:06.977497+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-4820-03,Fluorouracil,Fluorogold,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/11W2Rw-_KbKXbqqorqGk5PTeyQ9_baKU-/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-4820-03_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_11W2Rw-_KbKXbqqorqGk5PTeyQ9_baKU-_view_usp_drivesdk_cdbea8a6ef.pdf,page_text/DRP-4820-03_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_11W2Rw-_KbKXbqqorqGk5PTeyQ9_baKU-_view_usp_drivesdk_cdbea8a6ef.json,d8ebe5947bdb8f02d3d37aa2c1702d0fb65309f665fce99702f5984285c375df,482137,2,digital_text,"Fluorouracil (Fluorogold) is a clear and colorless to almost colorless solution. Fluorouracil is a fluorinated pyrimidine; it is chemically 5-fluoro-2, 4 (1H, 3H)- pyrimidinedione. It is a white to practically white crystalline powder which is sparingly soluble in water. Fluorouracil injection is an antineoplastic, anti- metabolite, sterile, non-pyrogenic injectable solution for intravenous administration. The molecular weight of Fluorouracil is 130.08 and the structural formula: C H FN O4 3 2 2TM Fluorouracil is present in two strengths 250 mg/5 mL and 500 mg/10 mL ampoules/vials.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,"Fluorouracil is effective in the palliative management of carcinoma of the colon, rectum, breast, stomach and pancreas.",1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T15:50:10.219605+00:00
