PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-4862,Amlodipine (As Besilate) + Valsartan,Exforge,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1G6o_JN2BQ1dtP2oOaGW1xrovDxjyJGi6/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-4862_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1G6o_JN2BQ1dtP2oOaGW1xrovDxjyJGi6_view_usp_drivesdk_a7562a8e90.pdf,page_text/DRP-4862_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1G6o_JN2BQ1dtP2oOaGW1xrovDxjyJGi6_view_usp_drivesdk_a7562a8e90.json,c73b76aae4b6cd53e2f3cff678dacbf76263483c4cc128b0613de2fefac6b90e,187696,14,digital_text,"Film-coated tablets. Active substances Amlodipine besilate and valsartan. Three strengths are available: • 5 mg/80 mg: 5 mg of amlodipine (as amlodipine besilate) and 80 mg of valsartan, dark yellow, round film -coated tablet with bevelled edges, imprinted with “NVR” on one side and “NV” on the other side. • 5mg/160 mg: 5 mg of amlodipine (as amlodipine besilate) and 160 mg of valsartan, dark yellow, oval film-coated tablet, imprinted with “NVR” on one side and “ECE” on the other side. • 10 mg/160 mg: 10 mg of amlodipine (as amlodipine besilate) and 160 mg of valsartan, light yellow, oval film-coated tablet, imprinted with “NVR” on one side and “UIC” on the other side. Amlodipine + valsartan (Exforge®) FCT are non-divisible and cannot be divided into equal doses. Excipients 5 mg/80 mg: Cellulose microcrystalline; crospovidone; silica, colloidal anhydrous; magnesium stearate; hypromellose, macrogol 4000, talc, titanium dioxide (E171), iron oxide, yellow (E172 ) 5 mg/160 mg: Cellulose microcrystalline; crospovidone; silica, colloidal anhydrous; magnesium stearate; hypromellose, macrogol 4000, talc, titanium dioxide (E171), iron oxide, yellow (E172) 10 mg/160 mg: Cellulose microcrystalline; crospovidone; silica, colloidal anhydrous, magnesium stearate, hypromellose, macrogol 4000, talc, titanium dioxide (E171), iron oxide, yellow (E172), iron oxide, red (E172 ) Pharmaceutical formulations may vary between countries.",1,1,Pharmaceutical form,Treatment of essential hypertension. Amlodipine + valsartan (Exforge®) may be used as initial therapy in patients who are likely to need multiple drugs to achieve blood pressure goals. The choice of amlodipine + valsartan (Exforge ®) as initial therapy for hypertension should be based on an assessment of potential benefits and risks.,1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T15:54:03.958976+00:00
