n countries.",1,1,Pharmaceutical form,Treatment of essential hypertension. Amlodipine + valsartan (Exforge®) may be used as initial therapy in patients who are likely to need multiple drugs to achieve blood pressure goals. The choice of amlodipine + valsartan (Exforge ®) as initial therapy for hypertension should be based on an assessment of potential benefits and risks.,1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T15:55:49.546836+00:00
