PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-5261,Cefalexin,Pneumonex,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1L-qZqNul9Yviy1Doi5EiWtu7sRc6RCxy/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-5261_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1L-qZqNul9Yviy1Doi5EiWtu7sRc6RCxy_view_usp_drivesdk_8ee7e9f4e3.pdf,page_text/DRP-5261_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1L-qZqNul9Yviy1Doi5EiWtu7sRc6RCxy_view_usp_drivesdk_8ee7e9f4e3.json,f769f054ce8722df53e720f68fabfacb93641a1c5d132f0cfc0cc3341ace3da7,425452,1,digital_text,"Cefalexin (Pneumonex) 125 mg / 5 mL Powder for Suspension is a white to pinkish white powder, pink suspension upon reconstitution with cherry flavor.",1,1,DESCRIPTION:,"Cefalexin is indicated in the treatment of the following infections when caused by susceptible strains of the designated microorganisms. Respiratory tract infections caused by S. pneumoniae and group A. beta-hemolytic streptococci (Penicillin is the usual drug of choice in the treatment and prevention of streptococci from the nasopharynx, however, substantial data establishing the efficacy of Cefalexin in the subsequent prevention of rheumatic fever are not available at present. Bacterial sinusitis caused by streptococci, S. pneumoniae and S. aureus (methicillin-sensitive only); Otitis media due to S. pneumoniae, H. influenzae, staphylococci, streptococci, and N. catarrhalis. Skin and soft tissue infections caused by staphylococci, and/or streptococci; Bone and joint infections caused by staphylococci and/or P. mirabilis; Genitourinary tract infections including acute prostatitis caused by E. coli, P. mirabilis, and Klebsiella sp. Dental infections caused by staphylococci and/or streptococci. Note – Appropriate culture and susceptibility test should be initiated prior to and during therapy. Renal function studies should be performed when indicated.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T16:16:42.490100+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-5262,,Mucomed,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CekzYuxz5PTVm5kMSRM2ucVv1kkHG3UT/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-5262_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1CekzYuxz5PTVm5kMSRM2ucVv1kkHG3UT_view_usp_drivesdk_97ac0e2f8f.pdf,page_text/DRP-5262_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1CekzYuxz5PTVm5kMSRM2ucVv1kkHG3UT_view_usp_drivesdk_97ac0e2f8f.json,059794731f5616aad946e3483157ac260910ab58e744888feac6f8e1a9a2dddf,630828,1,digital_text,"Diphenhydramine Hydrochloride 25mg Capsule is a white powder in orange cap/white body capsule, EGC size “3”.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Diphenhydramine is used for the symptomatic relief of allergic conditions including urticaria and angioedema, rhinitis and conjunctivitis, and in pruritic skin disorders. It is also used for its antiemetic properties in the treatment of nausea and vomiting, particularly in the prevention and treatment of motion sickness and in the treatment of vertigo of various causes.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T16:16:48.851731+00:00
