PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-5629,Metronidazole,Quinozole,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_bAAqKalPH0kCKswXg9GgNP0z-RmfTeL/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-5629_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1_bAAqKalPH0kCKswXg9GgNP0z-RmfTeL_view_usp_drivesdk_d5b71d0b36.pdf,page_text/DRP-5629_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1_bAAqKalPH0kCKswXg9GgNP0z-RmfTeL_view_usp_drivesdk_d5b71d0b36.json,fc46cebb0ba4061ba854756fe59ffc4b9f2784e5fd9ab1514161ec85dde65838,1570365,2,digital_text,"An almost colorless to pale yellow solution. Each single dose bottle contains sterile, Isotonic, Non-Pyrogenic metronidazole 500 mg.",1,1,DESCRIPTION,"Used in the treatment of susceptible protozoal infections such as amoebiasis, balantidiasis, blastocystis hominis infections, giardiasis and trichomoniasis; it has also been tried in leishmaniasis and microsporidiosis; also used in the treatment and prophylaxis of anaerobic bacterial infections; used to eradicate Helicobacter pylori in peptic ulcer disease; also used in the treatment of rosacea and dracunculiasis (guinea-worm infection) and has been given in the treatment of perianal Crohn's disease and hepatic encephalopathy.",1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T17:15:51.568258+00:00
