PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-5671-02,Citicoline,None,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pi2eCTYEZI7dyF5w7Ae_DUvyy5vAyZbO/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-5671-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1pi2eCTYEZI7dyF5w7Ae_DUvyy5vAyZbO_view_usp_drivesdk_bafe7eb5dd.pdf,page_text/DRP-5671-02_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1pi2eCTYEZI7dyF5w7Ae_DUvyy5vAyZbO_view_usp_drivesdk_bafe7eb5dd.json,dec53d1a65d287501fd9e0cd19080b8595453834ec17ce77b9faa923c920ba96,466043,2,digital_text,,,,,"Acute and recovery phase of cerebral infarction (e.g., ischemia due to stroke). Cognitive dysfunction due to degenerative (i.e., Alzheimer's disease) and cerebrovascular disease. Cerebral insufficiency (e.g., dizziness, memory loss, poor concentration, disorientation) due to head trauma or brain injury.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T17:16:43.127064+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-5679,Methyldopa,Unbranded,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/18DHlWqldoK_bh0x-tLBy_pMi8Y1LPVi8/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-5679_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_18DHlWqldoK_bh0x-tLBy_pMi8Y1LPVi8_view_usp_drivesdk_975765bf06.pdf,page_text/DRP-5679_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_18DHlWqldoK_bh0x-tLBy_pMi8Y1LPVi8_view_usp_drivesdk_975765bf06.json,ca0a47b88b4d5219054e75ea9e3de244ae02d96226fe61c3ee6bc094fb6aecc6,1989237,2,ocr,"Methyldopa, the L-isomer of alpha-methyldopa, is an antihypertensive drug. Methyldopa 250 mg Tablet is a light yellow to yellow, round, biconvex, film-coated tablet, bisected on one side and plain on the other side.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Methyldopa is used in the management of hypertension, although other drugs with fewer adverse effects are generally preferred. Methyldopa may, however, be the treatment of choice for hypertension in pregnancy. Edema and tolerance sometimes associated with Methyldopa therapy may be reduced when itis given with a thiazide diuretic.",1,1,INDICATION:,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T17:16:55.431029+00:00
