PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-6051-06,Ketoanalogues + Essential Amino Acids,Nephrophar,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ON4fDdujlsrepzReV9Q52os20Zt1dv16/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-6051-06_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ON4fDdujlsrepzReV9Q52os20Zt1dv16_view_usp_drivesdk_909bde5f7b.pdf,page_text/DRP-6051-06_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1ON4fDdujlsrepzReV9Q52os20Zt1dv16_view_usp_drivesdk_909bde5f7b.json,3415f97994dfd27de2bfb4fac4d42e6a27d4ace1b414dceabcd63327abdf0cd0,437345,1,digital_text,,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,Or as prescribed by the physician. -Hypersensitivity to the active substances or to any of the excipients.,1,1,INDICATIONS:,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T17:31:16.013269+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-6051-07,Ketoanalogues + Essential Amino Acids,Ketocitab,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TjlMev9yXOAI9tVcrco8ZFSbcG0_XiBU/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-6051-07_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1TjlMev9yXOAI9tVcrco8ZFSbcG0_XiBU_view_usp_drivesdk_46567edbc2.pdf,page_text/DRP-6051-07_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1TjlMev9yXOAI9tVcrco8ZFSbcG0_XiBU_view_usp_drivesdk_46567edbc2.json,a14842c1c71dc03526841ca2f4b81ccc5548be75c140f1a29726b4ade321079c,455053,1,digital_text,"Total Nitrogen Content....................................................................36 mg (α-ketoanalogue to leucine, calcium salt) Calcium-3-methyl-2-oxo-butyrate ...................................................86 mg Calcium-2-oxo-3-phenylpropionate ................................................68 mg Calcium-DL-2-hydroxy-4-(methylthio) butyrate ..............................59 mg (α-hydroxyanalogue to methionine, calcium salt) L-Lysine Acetate USP...................................................................105 mg (α-ketoanalogue to phenylalanine, calcium salt) (α-ketoanalogue to valine, calcium salt) L-Threonine USP............................................................................53 mg L-Histidine USP...............................................................................38 mg L-Tryptophan USP..........................................................................23 mg Yellow coloured, capsule shaped both sides plain film-coated tablet. Colour: Quinoline Yellow & Titanium Dioxide.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Ketoanalogues + Essential Amino Acids do not induce hyperfiltration of the residual nephrons. Ketoanalogues + Essential Amino Acids containing supplements exert a positive effect on renal hyperphosphataemia and secondary hyperparathyroidism. Moreover, renal osteodystrophy may be improved. The use of Ketoanalogues + Essential Amino Acids in combination with a very low protein diet allows to reduce nitrogen intake while preventing the deleterious consequences of inadequate dietary protein intake and malnutrition. Concomitant administration of calcium-containing drugs may cause or aggravate elevated serum calcium levels.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T17:31:19.286060+00:00
