PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-6080,Atorvastatin (as Calcium),Itorvaz,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HEL_0C9AVVACUCFmab3qIdISnMTKUGxJ/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-6080_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1HEL_0C9AVVACUCFmab3qIdISnMTKUGxJ_view_usp_drivesdk_f5a419f607.pdf,page_text/DRP-6080_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1HEL_0C9AVVACUCFmab3qIdISnMTKUGxJ_view_usp_drivesdk_f5a419f607.json,fe7dcd285198f59b4af1605be23eba4c05cee6b17bf2aa5904ef40585241970d,405148,1,digital_text,"20 mg: Blue colored triangle shaped bi -convex film -coated tablet engraved with “ACME’ on one side and a break line on the other side. 40 & 80 mg: White, bi-convex, ovoid, film-coated tablet engraved with 'ACME' on one side and a break line on the other side. PHARMACODYNAMICS Atorvastatin is a synthetic lipid -lowering agent. It is an inhibitor of 3 -hydroxy-3- methylglutaryl-coenzyme A (HMG -CoA) reductase. This enzyme catalyzes t he conversion of HMG -CoA to mevalonate, an early and rate limiting step of cholesterol biosynthesis.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Atorvastatin as Calcium (ITORVAZ) is indicated in: 1. Hypercholesterolaemia a). Adjunct to diet for reduction of elevated total cholesterol, LDL -cholesterol, apolipoprotein B, and triglycerides in adults and children aged 10 years and older with primary hypercholesterolaemia heterozygous familial hypercholesterolaemia or combined (mixed) hyperlipidaemia when response to diet and other pharmacological measures is inadequate. b). Raises HDL -cholesterol and lowers the LDL/HDL and total cholesterol/HDL ratios. c). Adjunct to diet and non -dietary measures in reducing elevated total cholesterol, LDL -cholesterol, and apolipoprotein B in patients with homozygous familial hypercholesterolaemia when response to these measures is inadequate. 2. Primary prevention in Type II diabetes mellitus Reducing the risk of cardiovascular events in diabetic patients with at least 1 additional risk factor, without clinically evident coronary heart disea se irrespective of whether cholesterol is raised.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T17:32:16.979264+00:00
