PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-6405,Rosuvastation (as calcium),Rosubolic-10,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qwRJWvog6uo9bqpStEjRFUz7DyRGSWuX/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-6405_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1qwRJWvog6uo9bqpStEjRFUz7DyRGSWuX_view_usp_drivesdk_a09bc9f910.pdf,page_text/DRP-6405_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1qwRJWvog6uo9bqpStEjRFUz7DyRGSWuX_view_usp_drivesdk_a09bc9f910.json,162b1b1622803fd8c17271f7fc2d6fa3ced81fdc87e4392164bd5272ec8f209d,875407,1,digital_text,"Peach biconvex, round shaped, film-coated tablet.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Treatment of hypercholesterolaemia Adult s, adolescent s and children aged 6 years or older wi t h primary hyperchole sterolaemia ( typ e IIa including heterozygous familial hypercholesterolaemia) or mixed dyslipidaemia (type IIb) as adjunct to diet when response to diet and other non- pharmacological treatments (e.g. exercise, weight reduction) is inadequate. Homozygous familial hypercholesterolaemia as an adjunct to diet and other lipid lowering treatments (e.g. LDL apheresis) or such treatments are not appropriate. Prevention on Cardiovascular Events Prevention of major cardiovascular events in patients who are estimated to have a high risk for a first cardiovascular event, as an adjunct to correction of other risk factors.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T18:15:11.560296+00:00
