you keep this Medicine? Store at temperatures not exceeding 30°C. Keep away from heat and direct sunlight. Exposure to these conditions may lead to slight discoloration. When should you consult your doctor? Consult your doctor for any signs of adverse drug reaction. ""For suspected adverse drug reaction, report to the FDA: www.fda.gov.ph"". Seek medical attention immediately at the first sign of any adverse drug reaction. Registration Number: DRP-6701 Date of First Authorization: 29 June 2010 Availability: Foil strip x G's (Box of G's and 30's); Physician's sample, foil strip x 2's Manufactured by: PT. ABBOTT INDONESIA JI. Raya Jakarta-Begor Km. 37 Kel. Sukamaju, Kee. Cilodong, Depok Jawa Barat, Indonesia Imported and Distributed by: ABBOTT LABORATORIES Venice Corporate Center, 8 Turin St. McKinley Town Center, Taguig Metro Manila, Philippines Date of Revision of Patient Information Leaflet: June 2021 REVERSE Approval Notes PPIC Customer <:t � m u N Lf) ,-1 00 c.. Ji 0 Revision No. 1 [Page 2]",1,1,use.,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T18:32:49.442425+00:00
