PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-6961,Octreotide Acetate,Octritide,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PbucNCoblf73Njt3BRRQkKj68EqOVlOX/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-6961_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1PbucNCoblf73Njt3BRRQkKj68EqOVlOX_view_usp_drivesdk_2f39c8028c.pdf,page_text/DRP-6961_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1PbucNCoblf73Njt3BRRQkKj68EqOVlOX_view_usp_drivesdk_2f39c8028c.json,4a457b3e592264fa427ae9b4a3b7960e46dbce43ce1453b4c51930a4993f7eda,456192,1,digital_text,Clear and colorless solution.,1,1,Product Description:,"• For urgent treatment for esophagus-gastric varices hemorrhage due to liver cirrhosis, combining with special treatment (such as endoscopic sclerosing agent therapy). • For preventing postoperative complications of pancreas. • For relieving gastrointestinal-pancreatic endocrine tumors-related symptoms and signs, with sufficient evidences showing that the product has effects on the following tumors: carcinoid tumor with carcinoid syndrome; VIP tumor, glucagonoma. The effective rate of the product for treating the following tumors is about 50% (the cases for receiving the product are limited so far): gastrinoma / Zollinger-Ellison syndrome, insulinoma, growth hormone releasing factor tumor. • For the patients with acromegaly failing to get improved by surgical therapy, radiotherapy or dopamine receptor agonist treatment, it can control the symptoms, decrease growth hormone (GH) and somatomedin C level. It can be applied for the patients with acromegaly unable or unwilling to receive operation, and the patients at intermission stage without effect by radiotherapy.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T18:45:29.783253+00:00
