trol symptoms. episodes responded to aripiprazole treatment (see Pharmacodynamic can be associated with the underlying disorder; however, in some cases, properties). urges were reported to have stopped when the dose was reduced or the medication was discontinued. Impulse control disorders may result in harm to Aripiprazole is indicated for the treatment up to 12 weeks of moderate to the patient and others if not recognized. Consider dose reduction or stopping severe manic episodes in Bipolar I Disorder in adolescents aged 13 years and the medication if a patient develops such urges while taking aripiprazole (see older (see Pharmacodynamic properties). Undesirable effects}",1,1,indications,medium,needs_human_review,2026-06-30T19:01:11.308401+00:00
