PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-7614-01,Aspirin,None,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Rg5B7ITPR8_zSR1xJ9gv5uDTDu6Kh_lh/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-7614-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1Rg5B7ITPR8_zSR1xJ9gv5uDTDu6Kh_lh_view_usp_drivesdk_13725ce91b.pdf,page_text/DRP-7614-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1Rg5B7ITPR8_zSR1xJ9gv5uDTDu6Kh_lh_view_usp_drivesdk_13725ce91b.json,342f2c74d2628c1ce16aae712216f269ac236ffdbbd555906a240c29d188000c,460543,1,digital_text,"Aspirin is a salicylate NSAID and has many properties in common with non-aspirin NSAIDs. It has analgesic, anti-in/f_lammatory and antipyretic properties; it acts as an inhibitor of the enzyme cyclooxygenase, which results in the direct inhibition of the biosynthesis of prostaglandin and thromboxanes from arachidonic acid. Aspirin also inhibits platelet aggregation; non-acetylated salicylates do not.Aspirin 80mg is a light-pink to pink carnation-pink enteric coated tablet, round, biconvex and plain on both sides.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,Used in the initial treatment of cardiovascular disorders such as angina pectoris and mycocardial infarction and for the prevention of cardiovascular disorders such as stroke.,1,1,INDICA TIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T19:37:14.876436+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-7618-01,Hydrocortisone (as sodium succinate),Zelera,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FRtCXPs9rd3TTglDIgX-LBnsPChfVio5/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-7618-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1FRtCXPs9rd3TTglDIgX-LBnsPChfVio5_view_usp_drivesdk_d0ee8d240f.pdf,page_text/DRP-7618-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1FRtCXPs9rd3TTglDIgX-LBnsPChfVio5_view_usp_drivesdk_d0ee8d240f.json,583a0a4603e303120de21164f021abb2ecaf6acb53420c667e2a789525fa3239,841580,2,digital_text,White or nearly white hygroscopic powder,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,"Hydrocortisone Sodium Succinate for Injection is indicated for any condition in which rapid and intense corticosteroid effect is required such as: Endocrine disorders: Primary or secondary adrenocortical insufficiency Collagen diseases: Systemic lupus erythematosus Dermatological diseases: Severe erythema multiforme (Stevens-Johnson syndrome) Allergic states: Bronchial asthma, anaphylactic reactions Gastro-intestinal diseases: Ulcerative colitis, Crohn's disease Respiratory diseases: Aspiration of gastric contents Medical emergencies: Hydrocortisone Sodium Succinate for Injection is indicated in the treatment of shock secondary to adrenocortical insufficiency or shock unresponsive to conventional therapy when adreno- cortical insufficiency may be present.",1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T19:37:18.581941+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-7621,Telmisartan + Hydrochlorothiazide,Micardis Plus,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1S2R6VuwY8GqhvQP9FgcjH_7WNHPo-UIp/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-7621_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1S2R6VuwY8GqhvQP9FgcjH_7WNHPo-UIp_view_usp_drivesdk_80d494b9c8.pdf,page_text/DRP-7621_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1S2R6VuwY8GqhvQP9FgcjH_7WNHPo-UIp_view_usp_drivesdk_80d494b9c8.json,9aa91b11f4dc74096897308d5639dd2d6a0dceb231adfcc0c8f303cf40c34946,197116,18,digital_text,"Telmisartan/Hydrochlorothiazide layered tablets, 40/12.5 mg are bilayered tablets of oblong, biconvex shape. The two layers have different colors with the Telmisartan layer being white, the Hydrochlorothiazide layer is red. The white layer is marked with the Boehringer Ingelheim company symbol and the code H4. The tablets are for oral administration. Telmisartan / Hydrochlorothiazide layered tablets, 80/12.5 mg are bilayered tablets of oblong, biconvex shape. The two layers have different colors with the Telmisartan layer being white, the Hydrochlorothiazide layer is red. The white layer is marked with the Boehringer Ingelheim company symbol and the code H8. The tablets are for oral administration. Telmisartan / Hydrochlorothiazide layered tablets, 80/25 mg are bilayered tablets of oblong, biconvex shape. The two layers have different colors with the Telmisartan layer being white, the Hydrochlorothiazide layer is yellow. The white layer is marked with the Boehringer Ingelheim company symbol and the code H9. The tablets are for oral administration.",1,1,Product Description,Treatment of essential hypertension. As fixed dose combination Telmisartan + HCTZ (Micardis Plus) is indicated in patients whose blood pressure is not adequately controlled on telmisartan or hydrochlorothiazide alone.,1,1,Indications / Usage,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T19:37:22.749593+00:00
