PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-7884,Ketoanalogues + Essential Amino Acids,Alfaren,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XhypKwf_lXA8mP2R3lpHqveiHpnfsJPi/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-7884_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1XhypKwf_lXA8mP2R3lpHqveiHpnfsJPi_view_usp_drivesdk_ed8e008bf5.pdf,page_text/DRP-7884_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1XhypKwf_lXA8mP2R3lpHqveiHpnfsJPi_view_usp_drivesdk_ed8e008bf5.json,5a83b58716a787b25c6a495bbcfa4069986505dfbde2659c88077e6c3a207edc,58804,1,digital_text,"Ketoanalogues + Essential Amino Acids (Alfaren) is a combined preparation for the full supply of indispensable amino acids, with minimum nitrogen. It contains all amino acids essential for uremic patients, five of them are keto or hydroxyanalogues in the form of calcium salts, thus allowing reduction in the nitrogen supply and providing calcium. It s a medication for the treatment of chronic kidney disease patients on conservative management therapy (CKD stage I, II, III). In combination with very low protein diet, it helps in delaying the progression of kidney disease in the predialysis period.",1,1,DESCRIPTION:,Prevention and treatment of damages due to faulty or deficient protein metabolism in chronic kidney disease in connection with a limited dietary protein intake of 40g/day or less (adults). Usually this applies to patients whose glomerular filtration rate (GFR) is less than 25mL/min.,1,1,INDICATION:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-07-01T16:34:32.069701+00:00
