WHEN YOU HAVE TAKEN MORE THAN THE RECOMMENDED DOSAGE? If you have taken more than the recommended dosage, consult a doctor. WHEN SHOULD YOU CONSULT A DOCTOR? If any undesirable effect occurs. If the child is taking other vitamin-mineral supplement.",1,2,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T21:50:02.971349+00:00
