PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-8660-01,Sodium Valproate,None,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NkiwYLlLYxi5viXD5hvs08KURID5zEtv/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-8660-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1NkiwYLlLYxi5viXD5hvs08KURID5zEtv_view_usp_drivesdk_482363516a.pdf,page_text/DRP-8660-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1NkiwYLlLYxi5viXD5hvs08KURID5zEtv_view_usp_drivesdk_482363516a.json,fe2116baacdddddeec1620c7a0bd79ad81ea27b31a62073da7367a499a70e0b4,184757,1,digital_text,,,,,"It is used particularly in the treatment of primary generalised seizures, has notable benefit in absence and myoclonic seizures, also in partial seizures. It is also used to treat the acute manic phase of bipolar disorder and for the prophylaxis of migraine.",1,1,INDICATIONS,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-06-30T21:51:03.352438+00:00
