 these medicinal products do not provide adequate glycemic control. Sitagliptin tablet is also indicated as add-on to insulin (with or without metformin) when diet and exercise plus stable dose of insulin do not provide adequate glycemic control.",1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T21:59:45.528172+00:00
