PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9182,Clarithromycin,Biaxin,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1agrMvblOJkXLTc9nNTlowIMWSucUkRkr/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9182_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1agrMvblOJkXLTc9nNTlowIMWSucUkRkr_view_usp_drivesdk_c6531ef398.pdf,page_text/DRP-9182_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1agrMvblOJkXLTc9nNTlowIMWSucUkRkr_view_usp_drivesdk_c6531ef398.json,296473008ebfdeab31df73263248a8b3ff9b8d75a0bca538bae4d56902fc8d94,666120,1,digital_text,White to off white lyophilized powder.,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Clarithromycin 500 mg powder for solution for infusion is indicated when parenteral therapy is required for treatment of infections, caused by Clarithromycin-susceptible organisms in the following conditions: - Community acquired pneumonia - Acute exacerbation of chronic bronchitis - Acute bacterial sinusitis (adequately diagnosed) - Bacterial pharyngitis and tonsillitis - Skin and soft tissue infections Clarithromycin 500 mg powder for solution for infusion is indicated in adults and children 12 years and older. “Consideration should be given to official guidance on the appropriate use of antibacterial agents.",1,1,INDICATIONS,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T22:22:23.079502+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9183-01,Lactulose,Rifelac,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-oKfD7LsXlVxY1PxMFJRtEP-5WZwYR5e/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9183-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1-oKfD7LsXlVxY1PxMFJRtEP-5WZwYR5e_view_usp_drivesdk_da3538dcbe.pdf,page_text/DRP-9183-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1-oKfD7LsXlVxY1PxMFJRtEP-5WZwYR5e_view_usp_drivesdk_da3538dcbe.json,4612c95a9013ac836c4a6fa77a2f5bcd42b1efffbc92a463ee6d3a8bb77a2af5,500484,1,digital_text,Each 5 mL contains:,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Constipation: Regulation of the physiological rhythm of the colon. It is where a soft stool is considered of medical benefit (hemorrhoids, post colonic/anal surgery). Hepatic Encephalopathy: Treatment and prevention of hepatic coma or precoma. Within this context, however, it should be realized that hyperammonemia alone cannot explain the neuropsychiatric manifestations of HE. The ammonia, however, might serve as a model compound for other nitrogenous substances. Eq. to Lactulose .......3.33 g Lactulose Concentrate USP Lactulose as a prebiotic substance strengthens the growth of health promoting bacteria eg, Bifidobacterium and Lactobacillus, whereas, potentially pathogenic bacteria eg, Clostridium and Escherichia coli may be suppressed. This may lead to a more favorable balance of the intestinal flora.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-06-30T22:22:26.388144+00:00
