PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9406,Allopurinol,Logout,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/17_IHn80gzVV6T5eliEVUeJDwszedsBos/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9406_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_17_IHn80gzVV6T5eliEVUeJDwszedsBos_view_usp_drivesdk_3395b51942.pdf,page_text/DRP-9406_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_17_IHn80gzVV6T5eliEVUeJDwszedsBos_view_usp_drivesdk_3395b51942.json,97bedae82384998009644e9874e61165edf4bc36b9c3da3a961a8ad2b5ab9da1,451028,1,digital_text,White circular beveled uncoated tablets with “Inga” monogram on one side and line of division on the other side.,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,Hyperuricaemia associated with chronic gout; acute uric acid nephropathy; recurrent uric acid stone formation; enzyme disorders; cancer or cancer chemotherapy; management of renal calculi due to deposition of calcium oxalate.,1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-07-01T16:47:25.716367+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9409,Cinnarizine,None,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nP8BWZnAot3XigMnplJ9Q5nzdvK02VQh/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9409_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1nP8BWZnAot3XigMnplJ9Q5nzdvK02VQh_view_usp_drivesdk_23c426123b.pdf,page_text/DRP-9409_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1nP8BWZnAot3XigMnplJ9Q5nzdvK02VQh_view_usp_drivesdk_23c426123b.json,865ab06710e27f47ff6c6b624e2578d81e05056ec995e91462418afe1f0b2b8a,855560,2,ocr,"Awhite color round tablet one side is impressed with a score and the other side with “C’”. ‘COO. PHARMACODYNAMICS 1. Cinnarizine increases and normalizes cerebral circulation and thereby increase the oxygen supply of the arteriosclerotic cerebral vessels. It prevents and eliminates vascular spasms of the labyrinth. 2. The improvement of cerebral circulation is also sustained by the fact that Cinnarizine increases the blood flow as well as the blood and oxygen supply to the heart muscle. The heart capacity is improved. 3. The mechanism of action of Cinnarizine may be explained by its direct inhibitory action on the tonus of the smooth muscles of certain arterioles which renders less sensitive to certain contractile substances such as angiotensin. PHARMACOKINETICS In animals, cinnarizine is extensively metabolised, N-dealkylation being the major pathway. Approximately two thirds of the metabolites are excreted with faeces, the rest in the urine, mainly during the first five days after a single dose. Absorption In man, after oral administration, absorption is relatively slow, peak serum concentration occurring after 2.5 to 4 hours. Distribution The plasma protein binding of cinnarizine is 91%. Metabolism Cinnarizine is extensively metabolized mainly via CYP2D6, but there is considerable interindividual variation in 260mm the extent of metabolism. (42mm) Elimination The reported elimination half-life for cinnarizine ranges from 4 to 24 hours. The elimination of metabolites occurs as follows: one third in the urine (unchanged as metabolite and glucuronide conjugates) and two thirds in the faeces.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,"For the symptomatic treatment of nausea and vertigo caused by Meniere’s disease and other vestibular disorders, and for the prevention and treatment of motion sickness. Also used in the management of various peripheral and cerebral vascular disorders.",1,1,INDICATIONS,medium,needs_human_review,2026-07-01T16:47:34.848545+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9416-01,Iohexol,Hexolfree 300,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Q71WqwYluKwFUMZrYw34VF-3uSL05cHR/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9416-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1Q71WqwYluKwFUMZrYw34VF-3uSL05cHR_view_usp_drivesdk_740ddb9a42.pdf,page_text/DRP-9416-01_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1Q71WqwYluKwFUMZrYw34VF-3uSL05cHR_view_usp_drivesdk_740ddb9a42.json,349c5050f25fbd5ac1fd3b0032f43c64ae1b5a80a4e55abdfaa2c5c62cdb4f4e,15699631,4,digital_text,,,,,"X-ray contrast medium for use in adults and children for cardioangiography, urography, phlebography and CT-enhancement. Lumbar, thoracic, cervical myelography and computed tomography of the basal cisterns, following subarachnoid injection. Arthrography, endoscopic retrograde pancreatography (ERP), endoscopic retrograde cholangiopancreatography (ERCP), herniography, hysterosalpingography, sialography and studies of the gastrointestinal tract.",2,2,INDICATIONS :,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-07-01T16:47:52.467435+00:00
