u are on sodium restricted diet. Do not take more than the recommended dose. UNDESIRABLE EFFECTS OF THIS MEDICINE Vitamin C is usually well tolerated, but diarrhea, nausea, vomiting and nose bleed if taken with high dose. WHAT OTHER MEDICINE OR FOOD SHOULD BE AVOIDED WHILE TAKING THIS MEDICINE? The amount of Vitamin C in the product is not expected to interact with food or medicines. WHAT SHOULD YOU DO IF YOU MISS A DOSE? Take the missed dose and subsequent doses. Do not take extra medicine to make up the missed dose. SIGNS AND SYMPTOMS OF OVERDOSE Prolonged intake of Vitamin C in excess of 2g/day may lead to nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, /f_lushing and nose bleeds. WHAT TO DO WHEN YOU HAVE TAKEN MORE THAN THE RECOMMENDED DOSAGE? If you have taken the recommended dosage, consult your doctor. HOW SHOULD YOU KEEP THIS MEDICINE? Store at temperatures not exceeding 30°C. Keep away from direct sunlight. WHEN SHOULD YOU CONSULT YOUR DOCTOR? If undesirable effect occurs. ADVERSE DRUG REACTION REPORTING STATEMENT For suspected adverse drug reaction, seek medical attention immediately and report to the FDA: www.fda.gov.ph AVAILABILITY In blister pack x 10’s (Box of 30’s & 100’s) 500 mg Capsule VITAMIN",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-07-01T16:48:47.508336+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9554,Heparin + Allantoin + Allium cepa L. (Onion) extract,Clinderm,PIL_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pakBN32NfJi0714wIrW1n54xYiq8peB5/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9554_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1pakBN32NfJi0714wIrW1n54xYiq8peB5_view_usp_drivesdk_00c2b98ca0.pdf,page_text/DRP-9554_PIL_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1pakBN32NfJi0714wIrW1n54xYiq8peB5_view_usp_drivesdk_00c2b98ca0.json,3552847c1845f66be204530c331da7124ca4c430ecccdef285601f619168c049,474071,1,digital_text,Light brown water-soluble opaque gel.,1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,"Clinderm is indicated for hypertrophic and colloidal scars, movement restricting and cosmetically disfiguring scars that occur after surgery, amputation, burns and trauma. It is also indicated for Dupuytren's contracture and traumatic tendon contracture as well as for cicatricial scars.",1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-07-01T16:48:50.649225+00:00
PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9561,,,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eb9mHl_bOZ08JzojwWkds7PseOlt6yBZ/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9561_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1eb9mHl_bOZ08JzojwWkds7PseOlt6yBZ_view_usp_drivesdk_fe9ccc88f5.pdf,page_text/DRP-9561_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1eb9mHl_bOZ08JzojwWkds7PseOlt6yBZ_view_usp_drivesdk_fe9ccc88f5.json,4a712e652b46e2327d3d5bc3486ae8d1476dafa9b5a2b617c2023edf8e0ea946,2466068,1,digital_text,"Yellow coloured, oblong shaped, biconvex, film-coated tablet plain on both side.",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION:,For prevention and treatment of damages due to faulty or deficient protein metabolism in chronic kidney disease in connection with a limited dietary protein intake of 40 g/day or less (adult). Usually this applies to patients whose glomerular filtration rate (GFR) is < 25 mL/min.,1,1,INDICATIONS:,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-07-01T16:48:54.269387+00:00
