PH_FDA_VERIFICATION_PORTAL,DRP-9596,Telmisartan,Micardis,PI_01,"Package Insert, Patient Information Leaflet, PI/PIL, Indication, SmPC, SPC",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EiT9-wWSnZ8f4qMkLKQsq9T05AsKhUFJ/view?usp=drivesdk,pdf/DRP-9596_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1EiT9-wWSnZ8f4qMkLKQsq9T05AsKhUFJ_view_usp_drivesdk_2cd5f57c54.pdf,page_text/DRP-9596_PI_01_https_drive.google.com_file_d_1EiT9-wWSnZ8f4qMkLKQsq9T05AsKhUFJ_view_usp_drivesdk_2cd5f57c54.json,ee40aeda0143cc9f6e0dfffa4727a150c98d3146e05abfc23d102dd260a20617,73915,2,digital_text,"Telmisartan tablets, 40 mg are white or off-white, oblong, biconvex, tablets. One side is marked with the code 51H, the other side is marked with the Boehringer Ingelheim company symbol. Telmisartan tablets, 80 mg are white or off-white, oblong, biconvex, tablets. One side is marked with the code 52H, the other side is marked with the Boehringer Ingelheim company symbol. The tablets are for oral administration.",1,1,Product Description,Treatment of essential hypertension in adults. Prevention of cardiovascular morbidity and mortality in adults 55 years or older at high risk of cardiovascular disease (see Pharmacological properties).,1,1,Indications,high,machine_extracted_review_recommended,2026-07-01T16:49:01.316289+00:00
