 Cetirizine (Allertin) Tablets are white coloured oblong biconvex film-coated tablets having a break line mark on one side and other side plain of each tablet. Availability: Alu/ PVC Blister Pack x 10's (Box of 100's) ADR Reporting Statement: For suspected adverse drug reactions, report to the FDA: www.fda.gov.ph. Seek medical attention immediately at the first sign of any adverse drug reaction. Registration Number: DRP-9619 Date of First Authorization: October 26, 2021 Date of Revision of Patient Information Leaflet: Noveber 5, 2024 Cetirizine Hydrochloride 10 mg Film-Coated Tablet ANTIHISTAMINE Allertin Imported and Distributed by: Ambicare Pharmaceuticals Inc. Amsterdam Extn., Merville Park2F Ambica Building, Subd., Parañaque , Metro Manila Manufactured by: Umedica Laboratories Pvt. Ltd. Plot No. 221, G.I.D.C., II Phase, Vapi, Gujarat, 396195, India [Page 2]",1,1,eruption.,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-07-01T16:49:29.294596+00:00
