S MEDICINE Vitamin C and zinc also function as cofactors of enzymes involved in collagen Do not take more than the recommended dose. formation and synthesis. Collagen provides strength and elasticity to the skin Do not use after the expiry date on the label and helps promote faster wound healing. WHEN SHOULD YOU CONSULT YOUR DOCTOR? STRENGTH OF THE MEDICINE Hf any undesirable effect occurs. Please see formulation. AVAILABILITY WHAT IS THE MEDICINE USED FOR? For the treatment and prevention of vitamin C and zinc deficiencies. Bax of 100 Capsules (Blister pack x 10's) HOW MUCH AND HOW OFTEN SHOULD YOU USE THIS MEDICINE? Adult ORP-9721 Orally, one capsule once a day. Or, as prescribed by the physician. Date of First Authorization : May 2021 Adverse Drug Reaction Reporting Statement Date of Revision : March 2022 & For suspected adverse drug reaction, seek medical attention immediately and Reg. POPHIL. feport to the FDA at ww.fda.gov.ph AND Unilab at +632-8-UNILAB-1 Manufactured (+632-8-864522-1) for Metro Manila or toll-free +1-800-10-UNILAB-1 for or e-mail com.ph Am-Europharma p By reporting undesirable effects, you can help provide more information on the safety of this medicine. For UNILAB, Inc. No, 66 United Street, Mandaluyong, Metro Manila, Le ieleaikcekstonital ete nm ae [Page 2]",1,1,PRODUCT DESCRIPTION,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-07-01T16:50:58.174830+00:00
