f you ingested more than the recommended dose, contact the nearest hospital or your doctor immediately. How should you keep this medicine? Store at temperatures not exceeding 30°C. Protect from direct sunlight. When should you consult your doctor? If symptoms persist or any undesirable effects occur, consult your doctor. “For suspected adverse drug reaction, report to the FDA: www.fda.gov.ph”. Seek medical attention immediately at the first sign of any adverse drug reaction. Registration number : HRP-287 Date of Renewal Authorization : July 2, 2023 Date of Revision of Patient Information Leaflet : August 4, 2023 Manufactured by the Distributed by: Marketing Authorization Holder:",1,1,Description of the product:,,,,,low,needs_human_review_missing_section,2026-07-01T17:03:39.524218+00:00
